tice-system.html', 'snippet': 'Forced individual arbitration often bears little resemblance to court: The rules tend to favor businesses, and judges and juries are replaced by arbitrators whose rulings are difficult to appeal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Deborah L. Pierce, an emergency room doctor in Philadelphia, was optimistic when she brought a sex discrimination claim against the medical group that had dismissed her. Respected by colleagues, she said she had a stack of glowing evaluations and evidence that the practice had a pattern of denying women partnerships.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Arbitration, a ‘Privatization of the Justice System’', 'kicker': 'Beware the Fine Print | Part II', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A ‘Privatization of the Justice System’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corkery, Michael', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARBITRATION, CONCILIATION AND MEDIATION', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Series', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Silver-Greenberg, Jessica', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corporations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-01T16:54:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'Jessica Silver-Greenberg and Michael Corkery', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver-Greenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Corkery', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e392eed0-c70d-54af-b704-fa3d62e0d3ec', 'word_count': 4541, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e392eed0-c70d-54af-b704-fa3d62e0d3ec'}, {'abstract': 'In a series of interviews televised on Sunday, the new House speaker signaled an antagonism that is likely to appeal to the conservatives within the Republican Party.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/02/us/politics/paul-ryan-says-he-wont-work-with-obama-on-immigration-reform.html', 'snippet': 'In a series of interviews televised on Sunday, the new House speaker signaled an antagonism that is likely to appeal to the conservatives within the Republican Party.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Speaker Paul D. Ryan said in a series of televised interviews on Sunday that he would not work with the Obama administration on changing immigration policy, effectively pushing off the issue to at least 2017.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/30/us/30ryan/30ryan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/10/30/us/30ryan/30ryan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/30/us/30ryan/30ryan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/30/us/30ryan/30ryan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/30/us/30ryan/30ryan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name