': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ca1f2ba-de47-5118-8824-eadfa96878d5', 'word_count': 965, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ca1f2ba-de47-5118-8824-eadfa96878d5'}, {'abstract': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton’s press shop is adding staff members and reshuffling existing personnel as it prepares for the final months of the nominating contest and the general election.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/11/01/hillary-clintons-press-operation-gets-an-overhaul/', 'snippet': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton’s press shop is adding staff members and reshuffling existing personnel as it prepares for the final months of the nominating contest and the general election.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton’s press shop, the focal point of her campaign over the summer as she tried to grapple with questions about her use of private email while at the State Department, is adding staff members and reshuffling existing personnel as it prepares for the final months of the nominating contest and the general election.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/01clinton-firstdraft/01clinton-firstdraft-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/02/us/01clinton-firstdraft/01clinton-firstdraft-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/01clinton-firstdraft/01clinton-firstdraft-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/01clinton-firstdraft/01clinton-firstdraft-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/01clinton-firstdraft/01clinton-firstdraft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/02/us/01clinton-firstdraft/01clinton-firstdraft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/01clinton-firstdraft/01clinton-firstdraft-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hillary Clinton’s Press Operation Gets an Overhaul', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-01T17:58:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Maggie Haberman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Maggie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haberman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/94d9940a-5bdc-56fd-a36c-3bd26f7e8651', 'word_count': 289, 'uri': 'nyt://article/94d9940a-5bdc-56fd-a36c-3bd26f7e8651'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Astronauts intend to wear GI underwear during their time in space in 1965.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/01/1965-gemini-astronauts-to-fly-in-long-johns/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Astronauts intend to wear GI underwear during their time in space in 1965.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — There’s no other way to phrase it: the Gemini-7 astronauts plan to spend ten days in orbit in GI underwear. If their funnel-shaped Gemini spacecraft doesn’t spring a leak, Air Force Maj. Frank Borman and his co-pilot, Navy Lt. Cmdr. James Lovell, intend to doff their silver spacesuits and continue the 14-day flight in regulation Air Force long johns. Long practiced by Russian cosmonauts, the so-called ‘‘shirt-sleeve’’ flight was not to become a part of the U.S. space program until the three-man Apollo spacecraft begin flying in 1967. Behind the change in plans is the absolute confidence that Gemini’s pressure hull will not expose the astronauts to the vacuum of space. If it did collide with a meteoroid or suffered explosive decompression for some other reason, the astronauts would pass out in less than a minute. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, November 2, 1965', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/blogs/02iht-oldnov02-lovell/02iht-oldnov02-lovell-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 921, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/02/blogs/02iht-oldnov02-lovell/02iht-oldnov02-lovell-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 921}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/blogs/02iht-oldnov02-lovell/02iht-oldnov02-lovell-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 667, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/blogs/02iht-oldnov02-lovell/02iht-oldnov02-lovell-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1334, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/blogs/02iht-oldnov02-lovell/02iht-oldnov02-lovell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/02/blogs/02iht-oldnov02-lovell/02iht-oldnov02-lovell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/blogs/02iht-oldnov02-lovell/02iht-oldnov02-lovell-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1965: Gemini Astronauts to Fly in Long Johns', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space and Astronomy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Aeronautics and Space Administration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-01T18:06:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3388afbe-c2d4-54e0-bcad-2bf89a08a412', 'word_count': 148, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3388afbe-c2d4-54e0-bcad-2bf89a08a412'}, {'abstract': 'Emergency medical workers told the police that Howard Unger, of the Bronx, may have had a seizure before his sedan drove onto a sidewalk packed with trick-or-treaters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/02/nyregion/driver-had-medical-episode-before-crash-that-killed-3-in-the-bronx.html', 'snippet': 'Emergency medical workers told the police that Howard Unger, o