ew', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e551fa3-de5c-5af5-b4a0-d2ba42f7c9f7', 'word_count': 406, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e551fa3-de5c-5af5-b4a0-d2ba42f7c9f7'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Valdés’s expansive career has included an influential hybrid band and, recently, a major concert in Havana.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/02/arts/music/chucho-valdes-the-pianist-reflects-on-irakere-and-his-career.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Valdés’s expansive career has included an influential hybrid band and, recently, a major concert in Havana.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chucho Valdés, the eminent Cuban pianist, bandleader and composer, carries himself with a sly balance of statesmanlike deliberation and youthful gusto. One day last month, not long before his 74th birthday, he folded his big frame onto a couch in a Midtown hotel and spoke animatedly about the last 40 years of musical exchange between the United States and Cuba — a dialogue that has largely defined his career, and one that he in turn has helped define.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/arts/CHUCHO/CHUCHO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/02/arts/CHUCHO/CHUCHO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/arts/CHUCHO/CHUCHO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/arts/CHUCHO/CHUCHO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1413, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u