, 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aff23e3b-a9d4-52f4-ad4e-0a0af8d079c8', 'word_count': 498, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aff23e3b-a9d4-52f4-ad4e-0a0af8d079c8'}, {'abstract': 'The film is a career retrospective of a brilliant if infuriating statesman, coupled with a son’s search for the father who had been absent much of his life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/02/arts/television/the-diplomat-a-sons-documentary-on-richard-c-holbrooke.html', 'snippet': 'The film is a career retrospective of a brilliant if infuriating statesman, coupled with a son’s search for the father who had been absent much of his life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In January 2011, seated alongside presidents and dignitaries at the Kennedy Center memorial service for Richard C. Holbrooke, his son David finally came to see his father as a historical figure.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/arts/HOLBROOKE/HOLBROOKE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/02/arts/HOLBROOKE/HOLBROOKE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 592}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/arts/HOLBROOKE/HOLBROOKE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1010, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/arts/HOLBROOKE/HOLBROOKE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2019, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/ar