l': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/02/us/politics/if-cancer-becomes-bidens-cause-a-bold-but-polarizing-doctor-is-on-call.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Patrick Soon-Shiong, who made a fortune developing a cancer drug, has developed a relationship with Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. as he weighs life out of office.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — One day last winter, desperate as his son fought for his life against a killer brain cancer, Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. and his family reached out to one of America’s most famous, and controversial, doctors for help.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/02whletter/02whletter-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/02/us/02whletter/02whletter-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 680}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/02whletter/02whletter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 904, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/02whletter/02whletter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1807, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/02whletter/02whletter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/02/us/02whletter/02whletter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/us/02whletter/02whletter-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'If Cancer Becomes Biden’s Cause, a Bold but Polarizing Doctor Is On Call', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'If Cancer Becomes Biden&#8217;s Cause, a Doctor Is on Call', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baker, Peter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cancer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Soon-Shiong, Patrick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R III', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-02T01:54:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9be610bc-24f8-5b59-b8e2-58ef11ee231c', 'word_count': 1364, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9be610bc-24f8-5b59-b8e2-58ef11ee231c'}, {'abstract': 'For the second consecutive game, Collins had waited to use Jeurys Familia, only to put him in an awkward position with runners on base. For the second time, Familia blew the save.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/02/sports/baseball/no-stranger-to-scrutiny-terry-collins-keeps-perspective.html', 'snippet': 'For the second consecutive game, Collins had waited to use Jeurys Familia, only to put him in an awkward position with runners on base. For the second time, Familia blew the save.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the eighth inning of Game 5 of the World Series, with the Mets facing elimination, Matt Harvey rushed over to Manager Terry Collins in the dugout, looking angry and shaking his head. Collins had tried removing Harvey from the game, in which he had held the Royals scoreless. The crowd was chanting Harvey’s name, urging Collins to keep him in. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/sports/02onbaseball-1/02onbaseball-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 523, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/03/sports/02onbaseball-1/02onbaseball-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 523}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/sports/02onbaseball-1/02onbaseball-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 892, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/sports/02onbaseball-1/02onbaseball-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1784, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/sports/02onbaseball-1/02onbaseball-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/03/sports/02onbaseball-1/02onbaseball-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/sports/02onbaseball-1/02onbaseball-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Relenting to His Ace, Terry Collins Opens Door to More Scrutiny', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A