-46e981211c32'}, {'abstract': 'Far too many prosecutors exploit peremptory challenges to create racially unrepresentative juries and win convictions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/02/opinion/excluding-blacks-from-juries.html', 'snippet': 'Far too many prosecutors exploit peremptory challenges to create racially unrepresentative juries and win convictions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One prospective juror did not make enough eye contact. Another appeared nervous and confused. A third had a son who was close in age to the defendant. A fourth was involved with the Head Start program.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/opinion/02mon1/02mon1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 744, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/02/opinion/02mon1/02mon1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 744}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/opinion/02mon1/02mon1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 826, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/opinion/02mon1/02mon1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1198, 'width': 966, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/opinion/02mon1/02mon1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/02/opinion/02mon1/02mon1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/02/o