//article/1dce1ccf-9f65-52b5-8c02-c480399d327c'}, {'abstract': 'Just as a new fashion trend of young models surfaces, a House bill proposes extending workplace safety regulations to cover them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/03/fashion/protecting-underage-models-becomes-a-federal-issue.html', 'snippet': 'Just as a new fashion trend of young models surfaces, a House bill proposes extending workplace safety regulations to cover them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paul D. Ryan, the new speaker of the House of Representatives, has another potential issue on his hands. For the first time since Brooke Shields donned her Calvins in the ’80s, spurring a national conversation, the question of underage models has reached the white dome of the Capitol.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/fashion/03OTR-B/03OTR-B-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/03/fashion/03OTR-B/03OTR-B-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/fashion/03OTR-B/03OTR-B-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/fashion/03OTR-B/03OTR-B-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/fashion/03OTR-B/03OTR-B-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/03/fashion/03OTR-B/03OTR-B-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbn