a664dca9a2e'}, {'abstract': 'Tuesday’s off-year election also features contentious votes on a marijuana legalization measure in Ohio and an anti-discrimination ordinance in Houston.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/04/us/gop-fears-losing-an-opportunity-in-kentucky-governors-race.html', 'snippet': 'Tuesday’s off-year election also features contentious votes on a marijuana legalization measure in Ohio and an anti-discrimination ordinance in Houston.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SHELBYVILLE, Ky. — A close contest for governor of Kentucky, where Republicans hope to win an office that Democrats have held for 40 of the last 44 years, highlights an off-year election Tuesday that also features several mayoral races and contentious ballot issues including an anti-discrimination ordinance in Houston and a marijuana legalization proposal in Ohio.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/us/04elections-web1/04elections-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/03/us/04elections-web1/04elections-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/us/04elections-web1/04elections-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/us/04elections-web1/04elections-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/03/us/04elections-web1/04elections-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':