y to streamline its own portfolio.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/04/business/energy-environment/shell-bg-group-lng.html', 'snippet': 'Shell, facing criticism for making a big deal at a time of low oil prices, is portraying the deal for BG as an opportunity to streamline its own portfolio.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Seeking to reassure investors, Royal Dutch Shell on Tuesday said its $70 billion acquisition of the BG Group would allow it to realize $3.5 billion in savings, shed $30 billion in uncompetitive assets, and expand its operations in the fast-growing liquefied natural gas industry.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shell to Focus on Liquefied Natural Gas in Deal for BG Group', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Business Briefing; Shell Says Buying BG Group Will Yield Billions in Savings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reed, Stanley', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Royal Dutch Shell Plc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BG Group Plc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-03T12:09:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stanley Reed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stanley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b17b559-4276-5ee8-86cc-7e31508b4bed', 'word_count': 644, 'uri': 'nyt://artic