ital affiliate, were selected as the final bidder for the commercial lending and leasing businesses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SYDNEY, Australia — GE Capital is in talks to sell its Australian commercial lending and leasing businesses to Sankaty Advisors and Deutsche Bank, said a person with direct knowledge of the matter, the last of a series of auctions of General Electric’s Australian financial assets this year that have included consumer lending and fleet-financing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'GE Capital Said to Be in Talks to Sell Australian Businesses', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'GE Capital Corp', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bain Capital', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deutsche Bank AG', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Electric Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-03T14:26:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brett Cole', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brett', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cole', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c08ab36-b2b2-5eb9-90da-4ff6382c33e2', 'word_count': 289, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c08ab36-b2b2-5eb9-90da-4ff6382c33e2'}, {'abstract': 'Ben Ratliff and Melissa Marturano talk about the critique of Ms. Newsom and her music.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2015/10/30/arts/music/30popcast_pod.html', 'snippet': 'Ben Ratliff and Melissa Marturano talk about the critique of Ms. Newsom and her music.', 'lead_paragra