70s. He was convicted of robbing a Long Island bank in 1980.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/04/sports/basketball/luther-burden-former-knick-who-served-time-for-bank-robbery-dies-at-62.html', 'snippet': 'Luther Burden starred for the University of Utah and played for the Knicks in the 1970s. He was convicted of robbing a Long Island bank in 1980.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Luther Burden, better known as Ticky, a sharpshooting guard who played briefly for the Knicks in the 1970s but whose life took an ignominious turn when he was convicted of robbing a Long Island bank in 1980, died on Thursday in Winston-Salem, N.C. He was 62.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/sports/04burden-obit-2-web/04burden-obit-2-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 832, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/04/sports/04burden-obit-2-web/04burden-obit-2-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 832}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/sports/04burden-obit-2-web/04burden-obit-2-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 739, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/sports/04burden-obit-2-web/04burden-obit-2-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1318, 'width': 951, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/sports/04burden-obit-2-web/04burden-obit-2-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/04/sports/04burden-obit-2-web/04bur