ial': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/d02739b5-43c0-5c37-a20f-47402bc07bc4', 'word_count': 943, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d02739b5-43c0-5c37-a20f-47402bc07bc4'}, {'abstract': 'The prospect of death changed him, and he finally allowed his friends and family to enter his life.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/04/how-a-l-s-rescued-my-father/', 'snippet': 'The prospect of death changed him, and he finally allowed his friends and family to enter his life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I laid my hand on his cold collarbone and — as the sun set behind my old school, which could be glimpsed from the bedroom window — he started to die. The vibrating pulses below his neck’s paper-thin skin ebbed. His breathing grew shallow until it disappeared entirely, like ripples on water that slowly level out.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-articleLarge.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/op