': 'nyt://article/0697d2b1-0b26-5dec-9c19-0b509bb5f941'}, {'abstract': 'A redesign of the document was intended to celebrate creativity and innovation in the country over the past five centuries, but critics point out it features seven men and only two women.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/05/world/europe/british-passport-design-women.html', 'snippet': 'A redesign of the document was intended to celebrate creativity and innovation in the country over the past five centuries, but critics point out it features seven men and only two women.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Britain’s newly designed passport was meant to celebrate the country’s creativity and innovation over the last five centuries, and officials have called it the “latest step in an evolutionary process” for passport security.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/world/05Passport-web/05Passport-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/05/world/05Passport-web/05Passport-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/world/05Passport-web/05Passport-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/world/05Passport-web/05Passport-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1455, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/world/05Passport-web/05Passport-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't