719ae24'}, {'abstract': 'Dickie Hammond’s guitar playing reminded me that I should play music for as long as I could, no matter what.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/04/punk-is-beautiful-dickie-hammond-1965-2015/', 'snippet': 'Dickie Hammond’s guitar playing reminded me that I should play music for as long as I could, no matter what.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dickie Hammond, one of British punk rock’s most gifted and revered guitarists, died last week. He was 50. Facebook and British and European blogs are filling up with tributes to Dickie — a “legend,” a “lord” and a “lovely bloke” — some of them calling him the best punk guitarist of all time. None of this is likely to make the obit pages outside North England.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/opinion/04takingnoteWeb/04takingnoteWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/04/opinion/04takingnoteWeb/04takingnoteWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 448}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/opinion/04takingnoteWeb/04takingnoteWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/opinion/04takingnoteWeb/04takingnoteWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/opinion/04takingnoteWeb/04takingnoteWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/04/opinion/