servatives seized on this and other shootings as evidence that critics of the police were fueling a wave of violence against law enforcement.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/us/05illinois/05illinois-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 502, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/05/us/05illinois/05illinois-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 502}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/us/05illinois/05illinois-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 857, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/us/05illinois/05illinois-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1713, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/us/05illinois/05illinois-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/05/us/05illinois/05illinois-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/us/05illinois/05illinois-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Officer’s Death Stuns Illinois Town a Second Time', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officer&#8217;s Death Stuns Illinois Town a 2nd Time ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gliniewicz, Charles Joseph (1963-2015)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fox Lake (Ill)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Illinois', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-04T16:32:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b993c1b8-7107-52b2-9791-1f7d5a98a399', 'word_count': 1368, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b993c1b8-7107-52b2-9791-1f7d5a98a399'}, {'abstract': 'The Beatles turned to videos when touring became difficult. Those early films and other footage of the band are in a new DVD collection called “1.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/08/arts/music/the-beatles-video-collection-1-baby-you-can-film-my-song.html', 'snippet': 'The Beatles turned to videos when touring became difficult. Those early films and other footage of the band are in a new DVD collection called “1.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Nov. 23, 1965, the Beatles entered Twickenham Film Studios, on the outskirts of London, for a marathon session. But the biggest band in the world wasn’t recording music — it was making promotional films for five of its singles.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/08/arts/08BEATLES1/1108BEATLES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/08/arts/08BEATLES1/1108BEATLES1-