}, {'abstract': 'Janet Yellen, the chairwoman of the Federal Reserve, told a House committee that the economy was “performing well” and that an interest rate increase “may be appropriate.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/05/business/economy/fed-yellen-congress-interest-rates.html', 'snippet': 'Janet Yellen, the chairwoman of the Federal Reserve, told a House committee that the economy was “performing well” and that an interest rate increase “may be appropriate.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Federal Reserve could raise its benchmark interest rate in December as long as economic growth continues, two senior Fed officials said on Wednesday, hammering that message in repeated public remarks.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'December Interest Rate Increase Is ‘a Live Possibility,’ Janet Yellen Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yellen Signals &#8216;Live Possibility&#8217; That Fed Will Act in December', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Appelbaum, Binyamin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yellen, Janet L', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-04T16:53:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/301f79ea-a388-59db-b4a4-500e8fd91dce', 'word_count': 1052, 'uri': 'nyt://article/301f79ea-a388-59db-b4a4-500e8fd91dce'}, {'abstract': 'Create a fall-themed veggie burger with acorn squash, cranberries and toasted almonds to star on your Thanksgiving table.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/04/vegetarian-thanksgiving-a-fall-themed-veggie-burger/', 'snippet': 'Create a fall-themed veggie burger with acorn squash, cranberries and toasted almonds to star on your Thanksgiving table.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bailey Rae, a food writer in Nashville, created a fall-themed veggie burger to star on her Thanksgiving table. The dish requires some prep time to bake, scoop and, well, squash, the acorn squash and caramelize the onions, but once those steps are out of the way, this is an easy dish to add to your Thanksgiving menu.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/science/04wellburger/04wellburger-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/04/science/04wellburger/04wellburger-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/science/04wellburger/04wellburger-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/science/04wellburger/04wellburger-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/science/04wellburger/04wellburger-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/04