/magazine/the-lessons-of-stanfords-sex-assault-case-reversal.html', 'snippet': 'Universities, and everyone else, have an obligation to scrutinize serious accusations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last February, I wrote a long article for this magazine about the relationship between Ellie Clougherty, a recent Stanford graduate, and Joe Lonsdale, a Silicon Valley entrepreneur and alumnus of the school. The couple started dating in 2012, after Lonsdale was assigned to be Clougherty’s mentor for an engineering course called Technology Entrepreneurship, which combined academics with business skills and access to Silicon Valley. After the relationship ended, Clougherty accused Lonsdale of sexual assault.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/magazine/04mag-stanford-1/04mag-stanford-1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 790, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/04/magazine/04mag-stanford-1/04mag-stanford-1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 790}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/magazine/04mag-stanford-1/04mag-stanford-1-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 779, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/magazine/04mag-stanford-1/04mag-stanford-1-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1557, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/magazine/04mag-stanford-1/04mag-stanford-1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/04/magazine/04mag-stanfo