 recent collection of photographs was shot entirely in upstate New York.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ryan McGinley’s Upstate New York', 'kicker': 'Travel', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGinley, Ryan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Team Gallery', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-04T21:59:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura Neilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c0f3294-971a-5c4b-860b-9e38072b8289', 'word_count': 396, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c0f3294-971a-5c4b-860b-9e38072b8289'}, {'abstract': 'Record-high ocean temperatures have contributed to a problem that poisons shellfish and kills sea mammals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/05/science/toxin-taints-crabs-and-kills-sea-mammals-scientists-warn.html', 'snippet': 'Record-high ocean temperatures have contributed to a problem that poisons shellfish and kills sea mammals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The authorities in California are advising people to avoid consumption of crabs contaminated by a natural toxin that has spread throughout the marine ecosystem off the West Coast, killing sea mammals and poisoning various other species.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/nytnow/04nytnow-crabs/04nytnow-crabs-articleLarge.jpg', 'heig