nyt://article/c97c6509-ed0a-559d-8015-8eab18424efc'}, {'abstract': 'At the Joyce, the choreographer featured his tribute piece “Geoffrey Holder Life Fete … Bacchanal,” which he has tweaked since its premiere in August.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/05/arts/dance/review-garth-fagan-dance-honors-geoffrey-holder-with-festivity-not-sorrow.html', 'snippet': 'At the Joyce, the choreographer featured his tribute piece “Geoffrey Holder Life Fete … Bacchanal,” which he has tweaked since its premiere in August.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Garth Fagan knows that mourning doesn’t need to be sorrowful. That attitude guides his latest dance, an ode to the prolific choreographer, performer, painter, director and designer — and Mr. Fagan’s friend — Geoffrey Holder, who died last year.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05FAGAN/05FAGAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 358, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05FAGAN/05FAGAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 358}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05FAGAN/05FAGAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 611, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05FAGAN/05FAGAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1222, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05FAGAN/05FAGAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05FAGAN/05F