el, it is tempting to dream in counterfactuals. It is also an almost certain formula for madness. The idea that Israel generates so many wistful what-ifs is itself a sign of the country’s fraught and fragile existence. No one would mourn what might have been if all of us could agree on what should be.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05BOOKEPHRON/05BOOKEPHRON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 948, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05BOOKEPHRON/05BOOKEPHRON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 948}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05BOOKEPHRON/05BOOKEPHRON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 648, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05BOOKEPHRON/05BOOKEPHRON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1296, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05BOOKEPHRON/05BOOKEPHRON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05BOOKEPHRON/05BOOKEPHRON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/arts/05BOOKEPHRON/05BOOKEPHRON-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Killing a King,’ on the Murder That Claimed a Peace Process', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Murder That Killed a Peace  Process', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ephron, Dan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rabin, Yitzhak', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Killing a King: The Assassination of Yitzhak Rabin and the Remaking of Israel (Book)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-04T22:55:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Senior', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Senior', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/caf7fdeb-487b-553c-8d95-58575111c226', 'word_count': 1138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/caf7fdeb-487b-553c-8d95-58575111c226'}, {'abstract': 'The automaker said airbags in 126,000 model-year 2008-10 vehicles might either inflate at improper times or not deploy during a crash.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/05/business/mercedes-benz-recalls-126000-vehicles-over-problems-with-airbags.html', 'snippet': 'The automaker said airbags in 126,000 model-year 2008-10 vehicles might either inflate at improper times or not deploy during a crash.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mercedes-Benz has joined the ranks of automakers troubled by airbag malfunctions, recalling about 126,000 vehicles in the United States, according to a report from the automaker posted this week on the website of the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mercedes-Benz Recalls 126,000 Vehicles Over Problems With