 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c67df9bf-4218-550d-bed6-c7969e2f76c6', 'word_count': 821, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c67df9bf-4218-550d-bed6-c7969e2f76c6'}, {'abstract': 'Wyatt Kahn’s Central Park puppet show features a rousing contemporary-art confab among versions of his works that have been brought to life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/04/t-magazine/performa-central-park-puppet-show-wyatt-kahn.html', 'snippet': 'Wyatt Kahn’s Central Park puppet show features a rousing contemporary-art confab among versions of his works that have been brought to life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the surprises on the lineup of this year’s Performa biennial, a self-reflexive puppet show by Wyatt Kahn, thrusts the artist — who identifies primarily as a painter rather than a performer — and his studio practice into the performance spotlight. “Her invitation came with carte blanche,” Kahn says, referring to the Performa director and curator RoseLee Goldberg. “So I pitched her a puppet show. I was thrilled when she said yes.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/t-magazine/04tmag-kahn-1/04tmag-khan-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/04/t-magazine/04tmag-kahn-1/04tmag-khan-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/t-magazine/04tmag-kahn-1/04tmag-khan-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/04/t-magazine/04tmag-kahn-1/04tmag-khan-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}},