t plan at work and lets them have money deducted from their paychecks or make electronic transfers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/05/business/us-offers-account-to-encourage-retirement-saving.html', 'snippet': 'MyRA is aimed at people who have no retirement plan at work and lets them have money deducted from their paychecks or make electronic transfers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After an extended test period, the federal government is widely promoting its new savings plan called myRA, which is aimed at people who do not have a retirement plan at work.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Offers Account to Encourage Retirement Saving', 'kicker': 'Your Money Adviser', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Offers Account to Encourage Retirement Saving', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Savings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Retirement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Individual Retirement Accounts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Treasury Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lew, Jacob J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-04T23:38:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/716083fe-8adf-5d1e-a7f1-54f4c168da69', 'word_count': 659, 'uri': 'nyt://article/716083fe-8adf-5d1e-a7f1-54f4c168da69'}, {'abstract': 'Plus: Del Toro’s concept shop, a holiday pop-up from Cuyana, Hike Nike NYC, and sample sales from Adam Lippes and Thakoon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/05/fashion/quintessential-britain-accessories-and-other-shopping-events.html', 'snippet': 'Plus: Del Toro’s concept shop, a holiday pop-up from Cuyana, Hike Nike NYC, and sample sales from Adam Lippes and Thakoon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cheerio! From Thursday to Sunday, 20 British companies will celebrate home on Madison Avenue with quintessentially British in-store programming. At Jimmy Choo, you can sip tea in Wedgwood china while shopping for glamorous footwear like the Dolly 100 silver glitter pump with fox-fur pompoms ($995), while Anya Hindmarch will offer free embossing on bespoke purchases, including keepsake boxes ($510 for a large size). Jimmy Choo is at 716 Madison Avenue; Anya Hindmarch is at 795 Madison Avenue.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/fashion/05SCOUTING_COMBO/05SCOUTING_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/05/fashion/05SCOUTING_COMBO/05SCOUTING_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/fashion/05SCOUTING_COMBO/05SCOUTING_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/fashion/05SCOUTING_COMBO/05SCOUTING_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/fashion/05SCOUTING_COMBO/05SCOUTING_COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/05/fashion/05SCOUTING_COMBO/05SCOUTING_COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/fashion/05SCOUTING_COMBO/05SCOUTING_COMBO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Quintessential Britain, Accessories and Other Shopping Events', 'kicker': 'Scouting Report', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quintessential Britain, Accessories and Other Shopping Events', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop-Up Stores and Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-04T23:38:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alison S. Cohn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alison', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Cohn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5fc2f0c1-e206-501a-bae4-ded3c03c8978', 'word_count': 395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5fc2f0c1-e206-501a-bae4-ded3c03c8978'}, {'abstract': 'It was the fourth time in six weeks that Hindus had killed Muslims they suspected of slaughtering, stealing or smuggling cows, which are seen as revered religious symbols.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/05/world/asia/hindu-mob-kills-another-indian-muslim-accused-of-harming-cows.html', 'snippet': 'It was the fourth time in six weeks that Hindus had killed Muslims they suspected of slaughtering, stealing or smuggling cows, which are seen as revered religious symbols.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — Amid a politically charged national debate over religious intolerance, a Muslim man was beaten to death on Monday by a mob of Hin