 profound and full of reflection, but the first compositions, too. “In the early periods, you get the exuberance, the promise,” he explains. “Sometimes you don’t get the refinement, yet you feel this sincerity.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/t-magazine/05tmag-haring/05tmag-haring-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/05/t-magazine/05tmag-haring/05tmag-haring-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/t-magazine/05tmag-haring/05tmag-haring-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1014, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/t-magazine/05tmag-haring/05tmag-haring-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2029, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/t-magazine/05tmag-haring/05tmag-haring-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/05/t-magazine/05tmag-haring/05tmag-haring-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/t-magazine/05tmag-haring/05tmag-haring-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Decoding Keith Haring’s Early Works', 'kicker': 'Art', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haring, Keith', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-05T16:36:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Moss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0275f0c-1b67-5b1c-8c42-a4f78d579e0a', 'word_count': 371, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0275f0c-1b67-5b1c-8c42-a4f78d579e0a'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Williams posted a story of foiling a man who tried to steal her phone, though surveillance video told a slightly less dramatic story.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/06/sports/tennis/serena-williams-thwarts-phone-theft-complete-with-highlight-video.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Williams posted a story of foiling a man who tried to steal her phone, though surveillance video told a slightly less dramatic story.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Serena Williams is a world-class athlete and is seen as a living embodiment of the phrase “girl power,” but it appears that a man who seemed to try to steal her phone on Tuesday was due for a reminder. Even so, surveillance video suggests the encounter was not quite as dramatic as Ms. Williams’s widely shared tale on Facebook.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/business/06serena/06serena-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/05/business/06serena/06serena-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/business/06serena/06serena-jumbo.j