 on brows or painted on lips, metallic makeup lends a supernatural sexiness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gold makeup plays a part in some of the most irresistible female archetypes — the sun-kissed blonde bombshell, the ancient queen, the glittering disco diva. Think of Brigitte Bardot and her honey-bronzed skin, Cleopatra and her gold-leaf eyes and gilded-to-the-hilt Studio 54 girls like Veruschka, Jerry Hall and Grace Jones. It’s no surprise that Ian Fleming, a master of male fantasy, dreamed up Auric Goldfinger, a villain who kills his bodacious victim by drenching her skin in gold paint. Watching ‘‘golden girl’’ Shirley Eaton’s metallic naked body glowing on pristine white sheets in the 1964 Bond movie, one feels like dying a golden death might not be such a bad thing.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '50', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/t-magazine/15tmag-12look_metallic-t_CA0/15tmag-12look_metallic-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/15/t-magazine/15tmag-12look_metallic-t_CA0/15tmag-12look_metallic-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/t-magazine/15tmag-12look_metallic-t_CA0/15tmag-12look_metallic-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/t-magazine/15tmag-12look_metallic-t_CA0/15tmag-12look_metallic-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15