ed playful furniture pieces. Then World War II began.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/06/arts/design/furniture-designers-with-fates-tied-to-the-nazis.html', 'snippet': 'Prewar artisans in Germany designed playful furniture pieces. Then World War II began.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Lampedo gallery in Lower Manhattan has assembled 30 pieces of playful furniture with some unsettling back stories for the exhibition “Berlin Deko — German Furniture 1910-1930.” The items in this show, on view through Nov. 21, have been arranged to create a kind of off-kilter living room, with jagged black shards painted and mounted on the walls, floors and ceiling.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES2/06ANTIQUES2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 2327, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES2/06ANTIQUES2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 2327}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES2/06ANTIQUES2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 264, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES2/06ANTIQUES2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 528, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES2/06ANTIQUES2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES2/06ANTIQUES2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'ra