rgh completed his trans-Atlantic flight on May 21, 1927, souvenir hunters started tearing apart his plane and trailing after him. Manufacturers put his image on lingerie, crayon boxes, calendars, cigar wrappers, pocket mirrors, board games, tapestries and bookends.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES1/06ANTIQUES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 949, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES1/06ANTIQUES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 949}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES1/06ANTIQUES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 648, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES1/06ANTIQUES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1296, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES1/06ANTIQUES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES1/06ANTIQUES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06ANTIQUES1/06ANTIQUES1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Lindberghs, From Triumph to Tragedy, an Exhibition at Morven', 'kicker': 'Antiques', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_head