or-on-5-favorite-things.html', 'snippet': 'Saint Laurent sneakers and black Acne jeans are couple of things that make his list.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Adam Rapoport, editor in chief of Bon Appétit, is more likely to be found in designer sneakers than kitchen clogs. Even so, he promises he makes a mean stuffing (“I literally use Jimmy Dean sausage,” he said. “It’s my mom’s classic and very right-down-the-middle American.” ) and perfect mashed potatoes, which he’ll serve on Thanksgiving. But first, he dishes up five of his favorite things.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/fashion/06LIST1/06LIST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/06/fashion/06LIST1/06LIST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/fashion/06LIST1/06LIST1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/fashion/06LIST1/06LIST1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/fashion/06LIST1/06LIST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/06/fashion/06LIST1/06LIST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/fashion/06LIST1/06LIST1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'he