k', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aileen Jacobson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aileen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jacobson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2ade020d-e53e-56ff-ac3f-3ef0525bbac4', 'word_count': 886, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ade020d-e53e-56ff-ac3f-3ef0525bbac4'}, {'abstract': 'Eli Cherkasky, 35, was ordered to perform 10 days of community service and complete counseling for alcohol abuse after being found guilty of attacking a 32-year-old woman last year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/06/nyregion/former-manhattan-prosecutor-avoids-jail-in-bar-assault.html', 'snippet': 'Eli Cherkasky, 35, was ordered to perform 10 days of community service and complete counseling for alcohol abuse after being found guilty of attacking a 32-year-old woman last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A former prosecutor in the Manhattan district attorney’s office who was found guilty of assaulting a woman at a bar avoided jail when a judge ordered him on Thursday to perform 10 days of community service and to complete counseling for alcohol abuse.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Former Manhattan Prosecutor Avoids Jail in Assault on Woman in Bar', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Former Manhattan Prosecutor Who Assaulted Woman at Irish Pub Avoids a Jail Sentence', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cherkasky, Eli', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schuck, Kirsten (1983- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scherzer, Ann E', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-06T01:19:22+0000', 'document_