mps in the road — moguls on the slopes — but yes, the Bond franchise has lived on, lucratively and babe-lusciously, for more than a half-century. Here’s what critics of The New York Times had to say about the films starring 007 No. 1, Sean Connery. Bosley Crowther picked up the pen for the first five.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '37', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06MISER2/06MISER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 348, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06MISER2/06MISER2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1208, 'width': 410, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06MISER2/06MISER2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06MISER2/06MISER2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06MISER2/06MISER2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Bond, James Bond,’ Through the Years', 'kicker': 'Friday File', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Bond, James Bond,’ Through the Years', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Connery, Sean', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bond, James (Fictional Chara