s, including the department responsible for environmental matters. She is widely seen as less partisan than many of her Conservative colleagues. Under the party rules, Ms. Ambrose will not be able to run in the coming party race to select a permanent replacement for Mr. Harper. But as leader of the opposition, she will get a pay raise as well as an official residence. Mr. Harper will continue to represent his Calgary, Alberta, constituency as a member of Parliament. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Canada: Interim Chief for Conservatives', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Americas; Canada: Interim Chief for Conservatives', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Austen, Ian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ambrose, Rona (1969- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harper, Stephen J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conservative Party (Canada)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-06T02:33:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Austen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Austen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/259a958a-3ae2-5545-8777-17e89bd94165', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/259a958a-3ae2-5545-8777-17e89bd94165'}, {'abstract': 'Lisa Immordino Vreeland’s documentary tracks Guggenheim, the collector and gallerist, on her European travels and her mission to promote Modern art.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/06/movies/review-peggy-guggenheim-art-addict-portrait-of-an-heiress-with-a-cause.html', 'snippet': 'Lisa Immordino Vreeland’s documentary tracks Guggenheim, the collector and gallerist, on her European travels and her mission to promote Modern art.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Peggy Guggenheim: Art Addict,” Lisa Immordino Vreeland’s sleek, entertaining portrait of the collector and gallerist who assembled one of the great troves of Modern art, cannot be accused of hagiography. From curators to historians to biographers, art world denizens describe Guggenheim’s flaws and failings: She had no formal training; she used art to promote herself; she was a narcissist. And that’s just in the first five minutes.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06PEGGY/06PEGGY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06PEGGY/06PEGGY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 768}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06PEGGY/06PEGGY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 801, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06PEGGY/06PEGGY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1601, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06PEGGY/06PEGGY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/06/arts/06PEGGY/06PEGGY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth