5776-82dc-de119f2132ad', 'word_count': 849, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ba1bd26-f32a-5776-82dc-de119f2132ad'}, {'abstract': 'Battles over water along a western river have been resolved by the combatants but they need Congress to sign off on their deal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/06/opinion/in-the-dry-west-waiting-for-congress.html', 'snippet': 'Battles over water along a western river have been resolved by the combatants but they need Congress to sign off on their deal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Klamath Falls, Ore. — DROUGHT in the West is an ugly thing. Rivers trickle away to nothing, fires rage, crops fail, ranchers go broke, tribal people watch fish die. As Westerners fight over the little water left, tempers crack, lawsuits fly and bitterness coats whole communities like fine dust.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/opinion/06marrisWeb/06marrisWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/06/opinion/06marrisWeb/06marrisWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/opinion/06marrisWeb/06marrisWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/opinion/06marrisWeb/06marrisWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1351, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/06/opinion/06marrisWeb/06marrisWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'th