 for the Mid Fairfield Junior Rangers in Connecticut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'STAMFORD, Conn. — Whether perched behind the bench clutching a paper cup of black coffee or tutoring 7-year-old skaters in the art of on-ice tag, Martin St. Louis approaches his new role with the same intensity that won him two N.H.L. scoring titles and a Stanley Cup.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Martin St. Louis Still Leads Rangers, but Now He Towers Over Them', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Happily Scaling Down From the Stanley Cup', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kreda, Allan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'St Louis, Martin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fairfield (Conn)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-07T02:48:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kreda', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kreda', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af537d63-2d0c-5f90-b672-43baf7f7e8af', 'word_count': 966, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af537d63-2d0c-5f90-b672-43baf7f7e8af'}, {'abstract': 'The Chinese navy is flexing its muscles in the South China Sea, but a belligerent response from the U.S. is exactly the wrong tack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/07/opinion/chinas-pacific-overtures.html', 'snippet': 'The Chinese navy is flexing its muscles in the South China Sea, but a 