remained committed to that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/08/sports/football/giants-punter-reclaims-spotlight-after-winding-road-from-lsu.html', 'snippet': 'Brad Wing is used to being the center of attention, and in his two years at Louisiana State, and subsequent two years in the N.F.L., he has remained committed to that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — In Australia, Brad Wing explained recently, kickers are a big deal. They are not called kickers; they are called scorers. In Australian rules football, the nation’s most popular sport, the men who kick the ball typically play full-forward, a focal position, where they call the plays, direct the offense and become sort of like, well, a quarterback.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/08/sports/DOG-GIANTS-1/DOG-GIANTS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/08/sports/DOG-GIANTS-1/DOG-GIANTS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/08/sports/DOG-GIANTS-1/DOG-GIANTS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/08/sports/DOG-GIANTS-1/DOG-GIANTS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/08/sports/DOG-GIANTS-1/DOG-GIANTS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/08/sports/D