01-b39d-b18d76974c1e'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Uggams will play a matriarch with dementia and squabbling children.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/08/leslie-uggams-to-star-in-colman-domingos-dot/', 'snippet': 'Ms. Uggams will play a matriarch with dementia and squabbling children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Leslie Uggams will star in the title role of the New York debut of Colman Domingo’s “Dot,” coming to the Vineyard Theater on Feb. 23. Ms. Uggams, a Tony and Emmy award winner, will return to the New York theater for her first extended run since 2008’s “The First Breeze of Summer.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/09artsbeat-uggams/09artsbeat-uggams-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/09artsbeat-uggams/09artsbeat-uggams-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/09artsbeat-uggams/09artsbeat-uggams-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/09artsbeat-uggams/09artsbeat-uggams-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/09artsbeat-uggams/09artsbeat-uggams-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/09artsbeat-uggams/09artsbeat-uggams-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnail