 fashion world, for the fashion world. And, with Raf Simons, it has its third smash issue.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/10/fashion/system-magazine-interview-seems-to-signal-why-raf-simons-quit-dior.html', 'snippet': 'It’s by the fashion world, for the fashion world. And, with Raf Simons, it has its third smash issue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Raf Simons left Christian Dior just over two weeks ago — a designer departure felt round the world — he did so with the usual anodyne joint news release containing generic quotes in which he and Dior management expressed their mutual appreciation and respect. That, they said, was the end of it; no one involved was giving any further interviews.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/10/fashion/10OTR-A/10OTR-A-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/10/fashion/10OTR-A/10OTR-A-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/10/fashion/10OTR-A/10OTR-A-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/10/fashion/10OTR-A/10OTR-A-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1299, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/10/fashion/10OTR-A/10OTR-A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/10/fashion/10OTR-A/10OTR-A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhei