': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/09d85dcf-81a3-5b70-ae94-f254f6d0bee5', 'word_count': 1849, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09d85dcf-81a3-5b70-ae94-f254f6d0bee5'}, {'abstract': 'There is no more welcoming, inclusive holiday on the American calendar, and this year we extend that feeling to the food itself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/11/dining/how-to-cook-thanksgiving.html', 'snippet': 'There is no more welcoming, inclusive holiday on the American calendar, and this year we extend that feeling to the food itself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sam Sifton emails readers of Cooking five days a week to talk about food and suggest recipes. Beginning today, that email will also appear on nytimes.com. To receive the email, register here.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/27/dining/27COOKING-WEDDINGCAKETURKEY1/27COOKING-WEDDINGCAKETURKEY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/10/27/dining/27COOKING-WEDDINGCAKETURKEY1/27COOKING-WEDDINGCAKETURKEY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/27/dining/27COOKING-WEDDINGCAKETURKEY1/27COOKING-WEDDINGCAKETURKEY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/27/dining/27COOKING-WEDDINGCAKETURKEY1/27COOKING-WEDDINGCAKETURKEY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/27/dining/27COOKING-WEDDINGCAKETURKEY1/27COOKING-WEDDINGCA