ts were once chopped in half may soon be altered to include buildings that rise four, six and eight stories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite what you might have heard, the cobblestones of the meatpacking district still run red. But now it is with flecks of beef tartare and hibiscus cocktails, the crimson soles of Louboutins and what looks like a blob of plasma but is actually red paint from one of the half-dozen artists’ stalls that followed the Whitney Museum downtown.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/nyregion/09APPRAISAL1/09APPRAISAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/09/nyregion/09APPRAISAL1/09APPRAISAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/nyregion/09APPRAISAL1/09APPRAISAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/nyregion/09APPRAISAL1/09APPRAISAL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/nyregion/09APPRAISAL1/09APPRAISAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/09/nyregion/09APPRAISAL1/09APPRAISAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/nyregion/09APPRAISAL1/09APPRAISAL1-thumbLarge.j