icle/dddfd645-a2b0-5135-96ca-a8e0b9192261'}, {'abstract': 'Mrs. Clinton will roll out her proposals to help veterans and to improve the treatment they receive at the Department of Veterans Affairs as she fields Republican attacks on her previous comments about the problems that have plagued the department.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/11/10/hillary-clinton-to-release-plan-to-address-veterans-affairs-scandal/', 'snippet': 'Mrs. Clinton will roll out her proposals to help veterans and to improve the treatment they receive at the Department of Veterans Affairs as she fields Republican attacks on her previous comments about the problems that have plagued the department...', 'lead_paragraph': 'WINDHAM, N.H. — On Monday, just after she officially registered as a Democratic candidate in New Hampshire, Hillary Rodham Clinton declared, “This election is about our veterans.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/us/politics/09firstdraftnl-clinton/09firstdraftnl-clinton-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/09/us/politics/09firstdraftnl-clinton/09firstdraftnl-clinton-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/us/politics/09firstdraftnl-clinton/09firstdraftnl-clinton-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/us/politics/09firstdraftnl-clinton/09firstdraftnl-clinton-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit':