hom the authorities did not identify, was questioned about the 1972 killings of unarmed civilian marchers by British soldiers in Northern Ireland.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/11/world/europe/bloody-sunday-massacre-arrest-northern-ireland.html', 'snippet': 'The suspect, whom the authorities did not identify, was questioned about the 1972 killings of unarmed civilian marchers by British soldiers in Northern Ireland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The police in Northern Ireland arrested a 66-year-old man on Tuesday in connection with Bloody Sunday, the infamous massacre of unarmed civilian marchers by British soldiers in Londonderry on Jan. 30, 1972. It was the first time anyone has been arrested in the massacre, for which the British government formally apologized in 2010.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/11/world/europe/11NIrenald-web/11NIrenald-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 456, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/11/world/europe/11NIrenald-web/11NIrenald-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 456}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/11/world/europe/11NIrenald-web/11NIrenald-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 779, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/11/world/europe/11NIrenald-web/11NIrenald-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1558, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/11/world/europe/11NIrenald-web/11NIrenald-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width