 'snippet': 'The victim, Leonard Manzo, was found unconscious in Howard Beach by emergency workers who were responding to a call there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A 90-year-old man died on Tuesday after he was found unconscious by emergency workers responding to a fire in his apartment in Queens, the authorities said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Man, 90, Dies in Queens Apartment Fire', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man, 90, Dies in an Apartment Fire', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manzo, Leonard (d 2015)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Howard Beach (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-10T14:38:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Rojas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rojas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2cfa6299-2fa7-5527-898d-23d97d37a017', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2cfa6299-2fa7-5527-898d-23d97d37a017'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Schmidt, elected in 1974, often appeared to disregard diplomacy, but he pushed his country into a forceful international role during the waning Cold War years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/11/world/europe/helmut-schmidt-assertive-west-german-chancellor-dies-at-96.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Schmidt, elected in 1974, often appeared to disregard diplomacy, but he pushed his country into a forceful international role during the waning Cold War years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Helmut Schmidt, the former West Ger