d the oxygen Ms. Ake-Salvacion needed to breathe, and ruled her death an accident. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nevada: Lack of Oxygen Is Cited in Death in Cryotherapy Tank', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | West', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nevada: Lack of Oxygen Is Cited in Death in Cryotherapy Tank', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ake-Salvacion, Chelsea (d 2015)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rejuvenice Cryotherapy (Nev)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nevada', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cryotherapy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Henderson (Nev)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-11T00:56:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Turkewitz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Turkewitz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/3aa63a98-3ed2-5763-8bc5-69111facbe47', 'word_count': 100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3aa63a98-3ed2-5763-8bc5-69111facbe47'}, {'abstract': 'Facing anti-Semitism in Ukraine, Dora and Motel Shkolnick obtained visas to come to the United States in 1973 with hopes of creating a better future for their children.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/11/nyregion/seeking-a-better-life-while-trying-to-forget-the-long-terrible-years-of-the-holocaust.html', 'snippet': 'Facing anti-Semitism in Ukraine, Dora and Motel Shkolnick obtained visas to come to the United States in 1973 with hopes of creatin