d2'}, {'abstract': 'The argument between Democrats and Republicans over law and disorder is a crucial dividing line.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/11/opinion/campaign-stops/how-much-do-black-lives-matter-to-the-presidential-campaign.html', 'snippet': 'The argument between Democrats and Republicans over law and disorder is a crucial dividing line.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The onslaught of confrontations between blacks and the police, as well as intense coverage on TV and online of college campus protests and of the Black Lives Matter movement, have decisively affected the Democratic Party’s position on a core issue: the use of force to maintain public order.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/11/opinion/11edsallWeb/11edsallWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/11/opinion/11edsallWeb/11edsallWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/11/opinion/11edsallWeb/11edsallWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/11/opinion/11edsallWeb/11edsallWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1289, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/11/opinion/11edsallWeb/11edsallWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/11/opinion/11edsallWeb/11edsallWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 's