ports/drone-racing-competition.html', 'snippet': 'Drone racing enthusiasts envision televised races and significant purses in their emerging sport.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — On a cool October night, after the stores in a shopping mall had closed, six young drone racers gathered in a subterranean parking garage to hone their aviation skills. Using remote-control joysticks, they navigated small X-shaped drones around pylons and beneath shopping carts, each vying for the lead.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gentlemen, Start Your Drones', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Maneuvering Into the Mainstream', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olsen, Erik', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Drone Racing Assn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-11T13:07:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Olsen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Olsen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/831aa225-1caf-58f2-b801-331b7d352dd7', 'word_count': 1914, 'uri': 'nyt://article/831aa225-1caf-58f2-b801-331b7d352dd7'}, {'abstract': 'The assertion by Luhut B. Pandjaitan came as Human Rights Watch released a report saying that elements of the military continued to undermine orders from Indonesia’s president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/12/world/asia/indonesia-wont-slide-back-into-military-rule-security-minister-says.html', 'snippet': 'The assertion by Luhut B. Pandjaitan came as Human Rights Watch released a report saying that elements of the military continued to undermine orders from Indonesia’s president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JAKARTA, Indonesia — Indonesia will not allow the country’s armed forces to make a political comeback and undermine civilian rule, the country’s security minister said on Wednesday, amid growing fears that Indonesia’s nascent democracy was backsliding toward its authoritarian past.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/world/12Indonesia-web/12Indonesia-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 813, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/12/world/12Indonesia-web/12Indonesia-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 813}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/world/12Indonesia-web/12Indonesia-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 756, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/world/12Indonesia-web/12Indonesia-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1153, 'width': 851, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/world/12Indonesia-web/12Indonesia-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/12/world/12Indonesia-web/12Indonesia-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/world/12Indonesia-web/12Indonesia-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'l