s, the once-fringe idea is now downright popular — even though it’s totally unfair.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Remember when the flat tax was a fringe idea? Competitors and others derided it\xa0when Steve Forbes made it the center of his 1996 presidential campaign. Though Mr. Forbes won the Arizona and Delaware primaries, he did poorly in Iowa and New Hampshire and dropped out of the race in March of that year. He did even worse in 2000, finishing third in the Delaware primary and ending his campaign soon after.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/opinion/11northWEB/11northWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/12/opinion/11northWEB/11northWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/opinion/11northWEB/11northWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/opinion/11northWEB/11northWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1393, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/opinion/11northWEB/11northWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/12/opinion/11northWEB/11northWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/opinion/11northWEB/11northWEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su