 Dr. Robert N. Taub could be crucial in determining his fate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/12/nyregion/friends-or-friendly-sheldon-silvers-trial-focuses-on-relationship-with-doctor.html', 'snippet': 'How jurors in the corruption trial of Mr. Silver, the former New York State Assembly speaker, perceive the connection between him and Dr. Robert N. Taub could be crucial in determining his fate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Their relationship seemed to pass the tests of friendship. Sheldon Silver and Dr. Robert N. Taub had mutual friends; their families had met, and even stayed at the same hotel during Passover celebrations.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/nyregion/SILVER/SILVER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 544, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/12/nyregion/SILVER/SILVER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 544}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/nyregion/SILVER/SILVER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 928, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/nyregion/SILVER/SILVER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1104, 'width': 1218, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/nyregion/SILVER/SILVER-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/12/nyregion/SILVER/SILVER-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credi