arrest in the case. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Northern Ireland: Ex-Soldier Is Released on Bail in Bloody Sunday Investigation', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Europe; Northern Ireland: Ex-Soldier Is Released on Bail in Bloody Sunday Investigation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chan, Sewell', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Northern Ireland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Irish Republican Army', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Service of Northern Ireland', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-12T03:46:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sewell Chan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sewell', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/0998e379-d161-5e19-8df4-e0b3fe9db147', 'word_count': 73, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0998e379-d161-5e19-8df4-e0b3fe9db147'}, {'abstract': 'In Arron Afflalo’s season debut, Kristaps Porzingis appeared to sink a winning 3-pointer at the buzzer, but the officials waved the shot off.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/12/sports/basketball/new-york-knicks-are-finally-healthy-besides-heartbreak-at-buzzer-charlotte-hornets.html', 'snippet': 'In Arron Afflalo’s season debut, Kristaps Porzingis appeared to sink a winning 3-pointer at the buzzer, but the officials waved the shot off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. — Nine games into his N.B.A. career, with four double-doubles to his credit and greats like Magic Johnson already hinting at future greatness to come, the 7-foot wonder Kristaps Porzingi