es.com/2015/11/12/arts/television/empire-season-2-episode-7-true-love-never.html', 'snippet': 'Everyone mostly stayed put this week, and it was unnerving.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an “Empire” season that has drawn its strength from the dizzying unpredictability of its moves, Episode 7 felt like a bit of a come down. Everyone mostly stayed put this week, and it was unnerving. The show’s sole constant is deceiving appearances. In a week light on kidnapping, theft, murder and backstabbing, is the calm just a temporary comfort to snatch out from under us later?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/11EMPIRE/11EMPIRE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/11EMPIRE/11EMPIRE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/11EMPIRE/11EMPIRE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/11EMPIRE/11EMPIRE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/11EMPIRE/11EMPIRE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/11EMPIRE/11EMPIRE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/09/arts/11EMPIRE/11EMPIRE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, '