': 'Apple Apologizes to Black Students Ejected From Store in Australia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Melbourne (Australia)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-12T17:51:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b23ad448-fd31-54ac-802d-942b7be6165a', 'word_count': 418, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b23ad448-fd31-54ac-802d-942b7be6165a'}, {'abstract': 'More on the mysteries surrounding (now-revised) estimates on rising white mortality.', 'web_url': 'https://douthat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/12/speculations-on-white-mortality/', 'snippet': 'More on the mysteries surrounding (now-revised) estimates on rising white mortality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I wrote my column\xa0last weekend on the much-discussed\xa0Anne Case/Angus Deaton paper on rising white mortality rates, and since then\xa0there’s been an important emendation to their data from Columbia’s Andrew Gelman: In a nutshell, Gelman argues that a finer-grained look at the numbers suggests that 1) the overall white mortality rate has re-stabilized, rather than continuing to rise, since the mid-2000s, that 2) the mortality increase\xa0was actually more notable for thirtysomethings and early fortysomethings than for the 45-54 cohort, and that 3)\xa0it’s white women whose mortality rates have kept on increasing over the last decade, even as white men have seen their mortality rates fall a little once again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Further Speculations on White Mortality', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gelman, Andrew', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-12T17:55:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f454e27-3c10-5f07-a358-3e5178e2b693', 'word_count': 950, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f454e27-3c10-5f07-a358-3e5178e2b693'}, {'abstract': 'A decade after her last album, Missy Elliott releases a video of a new single.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/12/missy-elliott-releases-new-single/', 'snippet': 'A decade after her last album, Missy Elliott releases a video of a new single.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A decade after her last album, Missy Elliott released a music video for her new single, “WTF (Where They From)” on Thursday morning. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/13/arts/13ARTSBEATMISSY/13ARTSBEATMISSY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 414, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/13/arts/13ARTSBEATMISSY/13ARTSBEATMISSY-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 414, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/13/arts/13ARTSBEATMISSY/13ARTSBEATMISSY-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/13/arts/13ARTSBEATMISSY/13ARTSBEATMISSY-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/13/arts/13ARTSBEATMISSY/13ARTSBEATMISSY-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Missy Elliott Releases New Video', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Missy Elliott (1971- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Pharrell', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-12T17:56:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Rogers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rogers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb54519a-a507-5550-8607-51b0009a5e27', 'word_count': 224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb54519a-a507-5550-8607-51b0009a5e27'}, {'abstract': 'A not-so-definitive list of other immersive, 360-degree shorts to view with your Google Cardboard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/12/magazine/more-virtual-reality-videos-to-watch.html', 'snippet': 'A not-so-definitive list of other immersive, 360-degree shorts to view with your Google Cardboard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last weekend, The New York Times delivered 1.2 million Google Cardboard viewers to home-delivery subscribers and asked them to watch our new virtual-reality film, “The Displaced,” about three refugee children growing up in Lebanon, South Sudan and Ukraine. This is the first in a series of virtual-reality films the magazine intends to produce. (We also experimented with V.R. before this with a short film about the “Walking New York” issue.) V.R. is still an emerging medium but there have already been a number of important projects from a variety of creators that indicate the potential of this technology. Below are a few of our favorites.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/magazine/12virtualreality-ss-slide-CJSL/12virtualreality-ss-slide-CJSL-articleLarge.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/12/magazine/12virtualreality-ss-slide-CJSL/12virtualreality-ss-slide-CJSL-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/magazine/12virtualreality-ss-slide-CJSL/12virtualreality-ss-slide-CJSL-jumbo.png', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/magazine/12virtualreality-ss-slide-CJSL/12virtualreality-ss-slide-CJSL-superJumbo.png', 'height': 726, 'width': 1089, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp