ight come as something of a surprise. Is he going in a new direction?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/t-magazine/12tmag-weiwei/12tmag-weiwei-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/12/t-magazine/12tmag-weiwei/12tmag-weiwei-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/t-magazine/12tmag-weiwei/12tmag-weiwei-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/t-magazine/12tmag-weiwei/12tmag-weiwei-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/t-magazine/12tmag-weiwei/12tmag-weiwei-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/12/t-magazine/12tmag-weiwei/12tmag-weiwei-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/12/t-magazine/12tmag-weiwei/12tmag-weiwei-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ai Weiwei Debuts His First Jewelry Collection', 'kicker': 'By Design', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ai Weiwei', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-12T21:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Natasha Garnett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Natasha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garnett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c912a75-49dd-5fad-aab5-4415bdd2a54d', 'word_count': 486, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c912a75-49dd-5fad-aab5-4415bdd2a54d'}, {'abstract': 'The title character, played by Christopher Abbott, grapples with his future while caring for his ailing mother in this Josh Mond film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/13/movies/review-in-james-white-facing-adulthood-with-uncertainty.html', 'snippet': 'The title character, played by Christopher Abbott, grapples with his future while caring for his ailing mother in this Josh Mond film.', 'lead_paragraph': '“James White” burrows so deeply into the consciousness of its title character, a flailing young Manhattanite played by Christopher Abbott (“Girls”), that his self-loathing and panic feel contagious. Who hasn’t, at a certain point in life, faced a sink-or-swim moment when a promising future suddenly began to seem out of reach? James combats the terror of grown-up responsibility with copious amounts of booze and late-night carousing in which he picks fights in bars and behaves like a brat. But Mr. Abbott’s performance makes you aware that James’s bad behavior stems from fear; deep down he has a warm heart.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/13/arts/13JAMES/13JAMES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 277, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/13/arts/13JAMES/13JAMES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xla