': {'original': 'By Ken Jaworowski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jaworowski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/1fe1f057-3b83-5b0b-8e04-62330cb09d3a', 'word_count': 679, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1fe1f057-3b83-5b0b-8e04-62330cb09d3a'}, {'abstract': 'The Giants’ starting left tackle tore a rotator cuff in his shoulder while rehabilitating a torn pectoral muscle he sustained in May.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/13/sports/football/giants-will-beatty-wont-return-this-season.html', 'snippet': 'The Giants’ starting left tackle tore a rotator cuff in his shoulder while rehabilitating a torn pectoral muscle he sustained in May.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Will Beatty, the Giants’ starting left tackle who tore a pectoral muscle lifting weights in May but was expected to give the team a late-season lift when he returned to uniform this month, will be sidelined the remainder of the year with a different injury: a torn rotator cuff in his shoulder. Beatty sustained the new injury while rehabilitating his pectoral muscle.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants’ Will Beatty Won’t Return This Season', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giants&#8217; Will Beatty Won&#8217;t Return This Season', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beatty, Will (1985- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-13T00:36:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname