1b87', 'word_count': 298, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c9dcda1-55fa-5d6b-a4a3-655a4c3f1b87'}, {'abstract': 'Emporiums of plant-based medicines offer products for what ails the mind, body and soul, even though scientific studies about their efficacy are inconclusive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/15/nyregion/wary-of-mainstream-medicine-immigrants-seek-remedies-from-home.html', 'snippet': 'Emporiums of plant-based medicines offer products for what ails the mind, body and soul, even though scientific studies about their efficacy are inconclusive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a recent afternoon, Ina Vandebroek was poking around the shelves of La 21 Division Botanica on the Grand Concourse in the Bronx. Its narrow aisles were crammed with thousands of votive candles, herbal potions and brightly colored plaster statues of saints.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wary of Mainstream Medicine, Immigrants Seek Remedies From Home', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Seeking Remedies From Home  ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Complementary Medicine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Botanical Garden', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flowers and Plants', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dietary Supplements and Herbal Remedies', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-13T22:27:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metropolitan', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Schiffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'las