orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3569d070-cbd3-5d20-93b3-1bad8037b49d', 'word_count': 1045, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3569d070-cbd3-5d20-93b3-1bad8037b49d'}, {'abstract': 'Pinkel announced on Friday that he has cancer, but his decision to resign comes after he backed his football players’ threatened boycott of a coming game amid racial protests on campus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/14/sports/ncaafootball/citing-illness-gary-pinkel-is-resigning-as-missouri-coach.html', 'snippet': 'Pinkel announced on Friday that he has cancer, but his decision to resign comes after he backed his football players’ threatened boycott of a coming game amid racial protests on campus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Saying that he has cancer and wants to focus on his family and his treatment, the head coach of the University of Missouri football team, Gary Pinkel, announced his resignation Friday. The move shocked the college football world after racial protests had put it in the national spotlight and Pinkel had backed his players’ threat to boycott a game.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/sports/ncaafootball/14MIZZOU/14MIZZOU-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 598, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/14/sports/ncaafootball/14MIZZOU/14MIZZOU-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 598}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/sports/ncaafootball/14MIZZOU/14MIZZOU-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1021, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/sports/ncaafootball/