Philharmonic’s Rachmaninoff festival, a focused whirl of animation onstage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/14/arts/music/daniil-trifonov-new-to-rachmaninoff-but-a-bold-and-youthful-echo.html', 'snippet': 'The 24-year-old Russian pianist-composer is the star attraction of the New York Philharmonic’s Rachmaninoff festival, a focused whirl of animation onstage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Geffen Hall is nearly empty. An usher roams the aisles. A technician adjusts microphones. A New York Philharmonic woodwind player fiddles with his reeds. Near the stage door sits a piano technician, his work on a Steinway being tested.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14TRIFONOVSUB/14TRIFONOVSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14TRIFONOVSUB/14TRIFONOVSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14TRIFONOVSUB/14TRIFONOVSUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14TRIFONOVSUB/14TRIFONOVSUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1244, 'width': 1743, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14TRIFONOVSUB/14TRIFONOVSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14TRIFONOVSUB/14TRIFONOVSUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14TRIFONOVSUB/14TRIFONOVSUB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Daniil Trifonov, New to Rachmaninoff, but a Bold and Youthful Echo', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One Russian Pays Homage to Another   ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Allen, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Geffen, David, Hall (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rachmaninoff, Sergei', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trifonov, Daniil', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Philharmonic', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-13T22:37:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Allen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Allen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f2fb399-f321-5393-ab5f-71473bec942f', 'word_count': 1010, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f2fb399-f321-5393-ab5f-71473bec942f'}, {'abstract': 'This 24-year-old Russian pianist has begun a three-week New York Philharmonic festival devoted to this composer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/14/arts/music/review-daniil-trifonov-brings-subtlety-to-rachmaninoff.html', 'snippet': 'This 24-year-old Russian pianist has begun a three-week New York Philharmonic festival devoted to this composer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For three weeks, on behalf of Rachmaninoff, the New York Philharmonic is putting itself at the disposal of the dazzling 24-year-old Russian pianist Daniil Trifonov. On Wednesday night at David Geffen Hall, Mr. Trifonov was a brilliant, uncommonly poetic soloist in that composer’s Rhapsody on a Theme of Paganini and Piano Concerto No. 2. Given the familiarity of these pieces, you might wonder why a Rachmaninoff festival was called for.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14RACHMANIOFF1/14RACHMANIOFF1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14RACHMANIOFF1/14RACHMANIOFF1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14RACHMANIOFF1/14RACHMANIOFF1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14RACHMANIOFF1/14RACHMANIOFF1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1392, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14RACHMANIOFF1/14RACHMANIOFF1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14RACHMANIOFF1/14RACHMANIOFF1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/14/arts/14RACHMANIOFF1/14RACHMANIOFF1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thum