mas Fuller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fuller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c8fadf6-5149-5238-88af-f2e6819d749c', 'word_count': 1048, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c8fadf6-5149-5238-88af-f2e6819d749c'}, {'abstract': 'A plan to export eight chimps from a research center in Atlanta to a zoo in England is a first test of an endangered species listing that says that only actions that benefit chimpanzees as a species should be allowed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/15/science/plan-to-export-chimps-tests-law-to-protect-species.html', 'snippet': 'A plan to export eight chimps from a research center in Atlanta to a zoo in England is a first test of an endangered species listing that says that only actions that benefit chimpanzees as a species should be allowed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Fish and Wildlife Service decided in June to classify all chimpanzees, captive or wild, as endangered, the ruling meant that any biomedical experiment or export of chimps from the United States, whoever owned them, would be subject to a strict permit process under the Endangered Species Act.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/world/CHIMPS/CHIMPS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 445, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/15/world/CHIMPS/CHIMPS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 445}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/world/CHIMPS/CHIMPS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 760, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit'