ermany, is returning from New York City to its home country after the German government allocated 30 million euros to make the journey possible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/15/nyregion/steely-veteran-of-the-sea-to-make-a-voyage-home.html', 'snippet': 'The Peking, a steel windjammer built in 1911 in Germany, is returning from New York City to its home country after the German government allocated 30 million euros to make the journey possible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Peking has faced gale-force winds and hurricanes. It has seen war and rough seas and rogue waves. Through it all, from its construction in 1911, it survived, and in 1974, it found a port where it could rest.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/nyregion/15PEKING1/15PEKING1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/15/nyregion/15PEKING1/15PEKING1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/nyregion/15PEKING1/15PEKING1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/nyregion/15PEKING1/15PEKING1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/nyregion/15PEKING1/15PEKING1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/15/nyregion/15PEKING1/15PEKING1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwi