, 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/world/MOOD/MOOD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/world/MOOD/MOOD-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/15/world/MOOD/MOOD-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/world/MOOD/MOOD-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Parisians Fear Terror Attacks Will Divide, Not Unite, the City', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Wary City, Fears Grow of Division and Distrust', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Attacks (November 2015)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bohlen, Celestine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Youth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bataclan (Paris, France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-14T21:51:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Celestine Bohlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Celestine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bohlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/90a251cd-fd5a-542f-9d82-849eaff4691e', 'word_count': 875, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90a251cd-fd5a-542f-9d82-849eaff4691e'}, {'abstract': 'He changed how the rest of us share our kids with the world. It’s almost his turn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/15/opinion/sunday/is-mark-zuckerberg-ready-for-facebook-parenthood.html', 'snippet': 'He changed how the rest of us share our kids with the world. It’s almost his turn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN a Manhattan cafe, I sit near a mother and her young daughter having tea. The daughter looks out the window. The mother takes pictures of her own shoes on a marvelously tiled floor, and of her daughter, who ignores her assiduously. I watch the mother artfully arrange the daughter’s teacup for a shot. I watch the daughter set her jaw. I watch the mother take a photo of the daughter and her teacup. The light is just so. I watch the mother consider her caption and hashtags and post it. I watch the mother scroll through her newsfeed. I watch the daughter stare out the window.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/opinion/sunday/15albert/15albert-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/15/opinion/sunday/15albert/15albert-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 452}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/opinion/sunday/15albert/15albert-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/15/opinion/sunday/15albert/15albert-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 959, 'width': 1274, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'cro