, an Associated Press photographer jumped on his bike and pedaled to one of the main targets.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/14/riding-to-the-scene-in-the-paris-attacks/', 'snippet': 'When news broke of the terrorist attacks, an Associated Press photographer jumped on his bike and pedaled to one of the main targets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The photographer Jerome Delay covers West Africa for The Associated Press. He was in Paris Friday night during the terrorist attack that killed at least 129 people. After covering the attacks and today’s reaction, he spoke to James Estrin about his experiences. The conversation has been edited.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Riding to the Scene in the Paris Attacks', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-15T02:34:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Estrin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Estrin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02df51cc-dce1-522d-bbca-dfc9af5b6f9b', 'word_count': 994, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02df51cc-dce1-522d-bbca-dfc9af5b6f9b'}, {'abstract': 'The recent violence in Paris and Beirut and the downing of a Russian passenger jet appear to be part of a centrally planned campaign of attacks by an evolving Islamic State.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/15/world/europe/strategy-shift-for-isis-inflicting-terror-in-distant-lands.html', 'snippet': 'The recent violence in Paris and Beirut and the downing of a Russian passenger jet appear to be part of a centrally planned campaign of attacks by an evolving Islamic State.', 'lead_p