s and the St. Thomas Choir performed Mozart’s Requiem and Haydn’s “Mass in Times of Distress” in a concert dedicated to the memory of its music director.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When John Scott, the revered organist and choirmaster at St. Thomas Church Fifth Avenue, programmed Mozart’s Requiem to open the church’s concert season on Thursday evening, he could hardly have anticipated that the performance would be dedicated to his memory. But in August, having returned from the first leg of a triumphant European recital tour, Mr. Scott, a vigorous 59, died of a heart attack.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/16/arts/16LUKES/16LUKES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 335, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/16/arts/16LUKES/16LUKES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 335}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/16/arts/16LUKES/16LUKES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 572, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/16/arts/16LUKES/16LUKES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1072, 'width': 1918, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/16/arts/16LUKES/16LUKES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/16/arts/16LUKES/16LUKES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/16/arts/16LUKES/16LUKES-thumbLa