/mindy-kalings-why-not-me.html', 'snippet': 'Kaling discusses life in an image-driven industry, and the perks and pitfalls of making it.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Why Not Me?” is the title of Mindy Kaling’s breezy new book, arriving on the heels of similar volumes by Tina Fey, Lena Dunham, Sarah Silverman, Amy Poehler and, notably, Kaling herself. Soon, Amy Schumer will tender her offering (which recently sold for a reported $8 million to $10 million, and will doubtless sell like hot cakes, if indeed hot cakes sell in the zillions) to the growing canon of \xadmemoir-slash-essay collections by women comedians and comedy writers. Clearly, there is something about the combination that’s working.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/books/review/22CHOCANO/22CHOCANO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 902, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/22/books/review/22CHOCANO/22CHOCANO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 902}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/books/review/22CHOCANO/22CHOCANO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/books/review/22CHOCANO/22CHOCANO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1363, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/books/review/22CHOCANO/22CHOCANO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/22/books/review/22CHOCANO/22CHOCANO-thumbStandar