memories and photos from their recent trip.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/16/t-magazine/building-block-designers-visit-taiwan.html', 'snippet': 'Kimberly and Nancy Wu, the sisters behind the brand, share with T memories and photos from their recent trip.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since 2011, the designers Kimberly and Nancy Wu have operated Building Block — an L.A.-based design studio that focuses on minimal accessories: handbags, shoes and goods comprised of leather, rubber and wood. Their studio — a whitewashed room (and former feminist art space) in Chinatown — reflects their attitude toward design: simple, clean, not overdone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Designers Behind Building Block Visit Taiwan', 'kicker': 'Travel Diary', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Taiwan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-16T22:44:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4135a13-28d9-5298-9480-3d579759441b', 'word_count': 240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4135a13-28d9-5298-9480-3d579759441b'}, {'abstract': 'States are increasingly creating their own retirement savings programs, and the Obama administration on Monday took steps to bolster the movement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/17/your-money/more-states-are-initiating-programs-to-encourage-retirement-savings.html', 'snippet': 'States are increasingly creating their own retirement savings programs, and the Obama administration on Monday took steps to bolster the movement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nearly 68 million workers do not have access to work-based retirement plans like 401(k)’s for companies and 403(b)’s for nonprofits and government employees. But that is now changing as more states have begun exploring different ways to create savings vehicles for those not covered by existing tax-deferred savings programs.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/business/17savings/17savings-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/17/business/17savings/17savings-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/business/17savings/17savings-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/business/17savings/17savings-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/business/17savings/17savings-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/17/business/17savings/17savings-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/business/17savings/17savings-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'More States Are Initiating Programs to Encourage Retirement Savings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'State-Based Retirement Plans on the Rise', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernard, Tara Siegel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Retirement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Savings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': '401(k), 403(b) and 457 Plans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AARP', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Individual Retirement Accounts', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-16T22:49:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Siegel Bernard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': 'Siegel', 'lastname': 'Bernard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd2357a8-ba33-5e93-8d38-890dfb8faafc', 'word_count': 791, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd2357a8-ba33-5e93-8d38-890dfb8faafc'}, {'abstract': 'An acquisition would move Pandora, the Internet radio company, into the field of on-demand music, where it would compete with Spotify and Apple Music.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/17/business/media/pandora-plans-to-acquire-the-assets-of-rdio.html', 'snippet': 'An acquisition would move Pandora, the Internet radio company, into the field of on-demand music, where it would compete with Spotify and Apple Music.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since it began 10 years ago, Pandora Media has been focused on one corner of the digital music universe: Internet radio. Now, it is also moving into the world of on-demand music, competing directly with outlets like Spotify and Apple Music.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pandora Plans to Acquire the Assets of Rdio', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pandora Media to Buy Assets of Rdio Service', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pandora Media Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rdio', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Audio Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAndrews, Brian P', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-16T22:50:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/930f532b-ed09-5e6e-bf8f-ee670791ae75', 'word_count': 653, 'uri': 'nyt://article/930f532b-ed09-5e6e-bf8f-ee670791ae75'}, {'abstract': 'The concluding volume of James Kaplan’s biography charts the singer’s continued rise to international fame and captures the changing times he transited.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/17/books/review-sinatra-the-chairman-his-world-his-way.html', 'snippet': 'The concluding volume of James Kaplan’s biography charts the singer’s continued rise to international fame and captures the changing times he transited.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He was America’s greatest vocalist: a consummate artist who redefined the possibilities of popular music, bringing to it an intimacy, an urban swagger and an emotional vulnerability that stamped songs as indelibly his own. A voice — no, the Voice — who could deliver “In the Wee Small Hours of the Morning” and “I’ve Got the World on a String” with equal authority and self-knowledge. A tough guy with Bond-like sophistication and savoir-faire, who sang with uncommon tenderness about loneliness and yearning. A ring-a-ding-ding Vegas showman, rarely without his posse, who could articulate the heartache and existential solitude of the human condition with more conviction than any singer on the planet.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/arts/17BOOKKAPLAN/17BOOKKAPLAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 857, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/17/arts/17BOOKKAPLAN/17BOOKKAPLAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 857}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/arts/17BOOKKAPLAN/17BOOKKAPLAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 717, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/arts/17BOOKKAPLAN/17BOOKKAPLAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1434, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/arts/17BOOKKAPLAN/17BOOKKAPLAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/17/arts/17BOOKKAPLAN/17BOOKKAPLAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/arts/17BOOKKAPLAN/17BOOKKAPLAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150