elle Équipe bistro, where he died along with 18 others on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — A few months ago, when Annabel Mouraud, a waitress, was feeling depressed after losing an uncle to cancer, Guillaume Le Dramp, a fellow waiter, arrived at the restaurant where they worked with a small gift and a wide smile: a children’s book titled “Little Miss Lucky.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/world/17VICTIMS/17VICTIMS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 457, 'width': 323, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/world/17VICTIMS/17VICTIMS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 457, 'width': 323, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/world/17VICTIMS/17VICTIMS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/17/world/17VICTIMS/17VICTIMS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/world/17VICTIMS/17VICTIMS-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Waiter Killed in Paris Attacks Is Remembered as a Bon Vivant', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Waiter Is Remembered as Bon Vivant With Sharp Wit and Wry Sense of Humor ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Attacks (November 2015)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Waiters and Waitresses', 'rank':