videos and podcasts.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/17/city-center-encores-unscripted-a-talk-show-about-musical-theater/', 'snippet': 'The series “City Center Encores! Unscripted,” will consist of three talks and performances that will be streamed live online, and later made available as videos and podcasts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'City Center Encores!, the program that stages revivals of rarely seen but beloved Broadway shows, is partnering with the Jerome L. Greene Space at WNYC to create a new talk show about musical theater.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': "‘City Center Encores! Unscripted': A Talk Show About Musical Theater", 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Talk Show About Musical Theater', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Encores! Great American Musicals in Concert (Series)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berman, Robert A (1970- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Jason Robert', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Friedman, Michael', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greene, Jerome L', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harnick, Sheldon', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Odom, Leslie Jr', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City Center Encores', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WNYC', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-17T17:52:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joshua Barone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joshua', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization':