e shadow, mascara, nail color and powders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/19/fashion/gold-tone-makeup-glitters-for-the-holidays.html', 'snippet': 'Products that include eye shadow, mascara, nail color and powders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If there’s ever a time to gild the lily, the holiday season is it. No wonder that luxury makeup companies are unveiling a trove of gold products for nails, lips, eyes and the face. And while they are surely festive, most are not too extreme for day, in finishes that lean more toward a shimmery flourish than a bold statement.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SKIN_COMBO/19SKIN_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 301, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SKIN_COMBO/19SKIN_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 301}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SKIN_COMBO/19SKIN_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 513, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SKIN_COMBO/19SKIN_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1026, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SKIN_COMBO/19SKIN_COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SKIN_COMBO/19SKIN_COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit'