e': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ac01712-b704-5827-b20a-a28038e8c091', 'word_count': 217, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ac01712-b704-5827-b20a-a28038e8c091'}, {'abstract': 'A pizza master takes over a former Exxon Mobil spot on the Upper East Side; Mathew Glazier plans a West Village restaurant; Sushi Dojo replaces its executive chef; and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/18/dining/giulio-adriani-turns-a-gas-station-into-service-station.html', 'snippet': 'A pizza master takes over a former Exxon Mobil spot on the Upper East Side; Mathew Glazier plans a West Village restaurant; Sushi Dojo replaces its executive chef; and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Service Station  The lubricant is now olive oil, not motor oil, at a former Exxon Mobil station that has been repurposed as a pizzeria, garage doors and all. Giulio Adriani, the consulting chef and a pizza master known for his fried montanara pie, is in charge of the domed oven that also turns out Neapolitan-style versions. Rounding out the menu are appetizers like arancini and fried calamari, and entrees that include lamb chops, skirt steak and lasagna. Bratislav Glisic, a consultant at Employees Only, has the same role here, and he’ll recommend a barrel-aged Negroni with the pizza, or a new-wave margarita with the margherita. “I’ve dreamed of pairing great pizza with great cocktails,” said Mr. Adriani, who added that he was planning to add more crunch to his Neapolitan pizza. The charcoal gray restaurant has a big bar, communal tables and a spacious terrace that may even be comfortable on a sunny day in late fall. (Opens Thursday): 500 East 62nd Street, 212-751-7860, servicestationnyc.com.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/dining/18OFF/18OFF-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/18/dining/18OFF/18OFF-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/dining/18OFF/18OFF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/dining/18OFF/18OFF-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/dining/18OFF/18OFF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/18/dining/18OFF/18OFF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/dining/18OFF/18OFF-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Giulio Adriani Turns a Gas Station Into Service Station', 'kicker': 'Off the Menu', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Service Station (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-17T20:01:18+0000', 'document