e could reunite a man with his dead ex-girlfriend, pleaded guilty to grand larceny and will be sentenced to four years of probation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Manhattan psychic admitted taking more than $550,000 from a customer whom she promised to reunite with a dead woman, in pleading guilty to grand larceny on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18PSYCHIC-web-1/18PSYCHIC-web-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18PSYCHIC-web-1/18PSYCHIC-web-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18PSYCHIC-web-1/18PSYCHIC-web-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18PSYCHIC-web-1/18PSYCHIC-web-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 820, 'width': 1227, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18PSYCHIC-web-1/18PSYCHIC-web-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18PSYCHIC-web-1/18PSYCHIC-web-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18PSYCHIC-web-1/18PSYCHIC-web-1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Manhattan Psychic Admits Taking Over $550,000 From Lovelorn Client', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Psychic Admits Taking Over $550,000 From Lovelorn Man', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Michael', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychics and Fortune Tellers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rice, Niall', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Delmaro, Priscilla Kelly (1988- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-17T22:29:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c852264-f5b7-5b3c-8476-12bf128b646c', 'word_count': 530, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c852264-f5b7-5b3c-8476-12bf128b646c'}, {'abstract': '“Choreograph,” coming soon to David Zwirner, presents a different way of deconstructing color.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/17/t-magazine/james-welling-choreograph.html', 'snippet': '“Choreograph,” coming soon to David Zwirner, presents a different way of deconstructing color.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the past three decades, the postmodern artist James Welling has “made abstract photographs, more normative pictures and experimented with different processes,” he says. “But for the last 10 years, I’ve been very interested in thinking about color.” He captured Philip Johnson’s Glass House in the late aughts through a set of colored filters and he digitally altered his 2009 pictures of Paris’s Maison de Verre. However, with “Choreograph,” on display starting tomorrow at David Zwirner, Welling has developed a more physical way of deconstructing color: feeding three black-and-white images into Photoshop’s red, green and blue color channels, and dragging the “adjustment” sliders until he creates one serendipitous, psychedelic composition.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'James Welling, Now in Technicolor', 'kicker': 'Art', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Welling, James', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-17T22:31:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Moss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dcf75e21-1a41-5d6f-a2f4-ee32341974cc', 'word_count': 366, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dcf75e21-1a41-5d6f-a2f4-ee32341974cc'}, {'abstract': 'The photographer’s latest show to experiment with color opens tomorrow at David Zwirner.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/11/17/t-magazine/james-wellings-choreograph.html', 'snippet': 'The photographer’s latest show to experiment with color opens tomorrow at David Zwirner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The photographer’s latest show to experiment with color opens tomorrow at David Zwirner.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/17/t-magazine/17tmag-welling-slide-AU6C/17tmag-welling-slide-AU6C-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/17/t-ma