ria)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Al Nusra Front', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Raqqa Is Being Slaughtered Silently', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-17T23:37:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Barnard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9eede5b6-1512-539c-92a7-ff0a1beefb04', 'word_count': 1410, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9eede5b6-1512-539c-92a7-ff0a1beefb04'}, {'abstract': 'Nearly half say that the city is a worse place to live under the mayor’s watch, and 51 percent say New York is now less safe, even as crime statistics reach historic lows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/18/nyregion/mayor-de-blasio-has-lost-support-of-white-new-yorkers-poll-finds.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly half say that the city is a worse place to live under the mayor’s watch, and 51 percent say New York is now less safe, even as crime statistics reach historic lows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nearing the midpoint of his term, Mayor Bill de Blasio is confronting a city that is deeply divided about his ability to lead, with his efforts to create a more liberal New York overshadowed by growing worries about homelessness and crime, a new poll finds.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18MAYORPOLL-web1/18MAYORPOLL-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18MAYORPOLL-web1/18MAYORPOLL-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18MAYORPOLL-web1/18MAYORPOLL-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18MAYORPOLL-web1/18MAYORPOLL-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18MAYORPOLL-web1/18MAYORPOLL-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18MAYORPOLL-web1/18MAYORPOLL-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/nyregion/18MAYORPOLL-web1/18MAYORPOLL-web1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mayor de Blasio Has Lost Support of White New Yorkers, Poll Finds', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Poll Shows Mayor Has Lost Whites&#8217; Support ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sussman, Dalia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', '