g excerpts are from an interview about how to defeat the Islamic State with Imam Mohamed Magid, the spiritual leader of the All Dulles Area Muslim Society, a large Muslim community in Sterling, Va. He has been working with other Muslim leaders and government agencies on countering radicalization. This year, he traveled to Nigeria, Sudan, Kenya and Ethiopia to discuss counterrecruitment and deradicalization strategies with religious and government leaders in those countries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/world/18isissidefour-web/18isissidefour-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/18/world/18isissidefour-web/18isissidefour-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/world/18isissidefour-web/18isissidefour-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/world/18isissidefour-web/18isissidefour-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1367, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/world/18isissidefour-web/18isissidefour-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/18/world/18isissidefour-web/18isissidefour-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/world/18isissidefour-web/18i