gent Man.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/18/arts/music/p-f-sloan-60s-songwriter-dies-at-70.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Sloan wrote the apocalyptic anthem “Eve of Destruction” when he was 19. It became a No. 1 hit for Barry McGuire. He also wrote, with Steve Barri, “Secret Agent Man.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'P. F. Sloan, a singer and songwriter of somewhat enigmatic repute, whose apocalyptic anthem “Eve of Destruction,” written when he was just 19, was a seminal protest song of the 1960s, not to mention a No. 1 hit for the singer Barry McGuire, died on Sunday at his home in Los Angeles. He was 70.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/arts/18sloan-obit-2/18sloan-obit-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 759, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/18/arts/18sloan-obit-2/18sloan-obit-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 759}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/arts/18sloan-obit-2/18sloan-obit-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 810, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/arts/18sloan-obit-2/18sloan-obit-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1620, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/arts/18sloan-obit-2/18sloan-obit-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/18/arts/18sloan-obit-2/18sloan-obit-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype