a812-5bd5-b9e1-e0caaeace37a', 'word_count': 1933, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75a5d359-a812-5bd5-b9e1-e0caaeace37a'}, {'abstract': 'France has been wounded. The solution is not to become like its enemies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/18/opinion/is-any-place-safe.html', 'snippet': 'France has been wounded. The solution is not to become like its enemies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paris — FRIDAY night, after the terrorist attacks in Paris, I went out into the streets. I was confused and afraid, of course. But the terrible things that had happened — I wanted to see them for myself, breathe them in, walk among them. It was a little past 11 and the streets were deserted, silent. Paris no longer existed. Paris had fallen.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/opinion/18taia/18taia-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 974, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/18/opinion/18taia/18taia-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 974}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/opinion/18taia/18taia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 631, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/opinion/18taia/18taia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1622, 'width': 999, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/18/opinion/18taia/18taia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/18/opinion/18taia/18taia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thum