sessions in the Western Hemisphere.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, November 19, 1940', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/blogs/19iht-oldnov19-bases/19iht-oldnov19-bases-articleLarge.png', 'height': 519, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/19/blogs/19iht-oldnov19-bases/19iht-oldnov19-bases-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 519}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/blogs/19iht-oldnov19-bases/19iht-oldnov19-bases-jumbo.png', 'height': 624, 'width': 721, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/blogs/19iht-oldnov19-bases/19iht-oldnov19-bases-superJumbo.png', 'height': 624, 'width': 721, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/blogs/19iht-oldnov19-bases/19iht-oldnov19-bases-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/19/blogs/19iht-oldnov19-bases/19iht-oldnov19-bases-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/blogs/19iht-oldnov19-bases/19iht-oldnov19-bases-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1940: U.S. to Lease 7 British Bases', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'M