n (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Imitation of Life (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Klute (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Mildred Pierce (Movie)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Reckless Moment (Movie)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Performance (Movie)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Safe (Movie)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Velvet Goldmine (Movie)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-18T17:40:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1166ec32-5d33-5697-a0fe-7bba0235f16d', 'word_count': 160, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1166ec32-5d33-5697-a0fe-7bba0235f16d'}, {'abstract': 'A comic actor continues his Manhattan comedy streak onstage with Nick Jones’s “Important Hats of the Twentieth Century.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/22/theater/carson-elrod-wears-a-new-comic-hat-while-facing-fashions-of-the-future.html', 'snippet': 'A comic actor continues his Manhattan comedy streak onstage with Nick Jones’s “Important Hats of the Twentieth Century.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some performers you simply want to watch in anything, and the quirky, dexterous actor Carson Elrod is on my shortlist. Fortunately, he hasn’t been hard to find of late. In the 20th anniversary revival of David Ives’s “All in the Timing” and Mr. Ives’s more recent “Lives of the Saints,” Mr. Elrod’s puckish humor has been a welcome presence. (That was also him, in blue body paint, spouting gibberish in “T