ection of clothes inspired by Wonder Woman.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/19/fashion/gwyneth-paltrow-valentino-goop-wonder-woman.html', 'snippet': 'The actress and Internet entrepreneur is joining with Valentino’s designers on a capsule collection of clothes inspired by Wonder Woman.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a recent morning, a soundstage in Long Island City, Queens, was filled with people. The photographer Terry Richardson was running about in one of his trademark flannel shirts. Organic food was being served by the truckload.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 879, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 879}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 699, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1398, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D/19FRONTROW-slide-ZQ2D-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thum