 need, and sample sales at Tabitha Simmons and Live the Process.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Skip your trip to the dry cleaner this week. On Friday, the Laundress, an eco-friendly detergent line founded by Gwen Whiting and Lindsey Boyd, who met studying fiber science at Cornell and left jobs at Chanel and Ralph Lauren to educate consumers about alternative fabric care, will open a shop in SoHo. The cedar-extract, sulphite-free wool and cashmere shampoo ($19) works wonders in the washing-machine delicate cycle. At 199 Prince Street.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SCOUTING_COMBO/16SCOUTING_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 477, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SCOUTING_COMBO/16SCOUTING_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 477}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SCOUTING_COMBO/16SCOUTING_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 814, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SCOUTING_COMBO/16SCOUTING_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1629, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SCOUTING_COMBO/16SCOUTING_COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/19/fashion/19SCOUTING_COMBO/16SCOUTING_COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credi