2015/11/18/nyregion/skelos-audio-2.html', 'snippet': 'Adam Skelos calls to congratulate his father for ousting Senator Jeffrey Klein from his position as co-leader of the Senate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Adam Skelos calls to congratulate his father for ousting Senator Jeffrey Klein from his position as co-leader of the Senate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Taking Power', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-11-19T03:57:34+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/1e4466df-d7af-5686-9f68-726c42775b69', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/1e4466df-d7af-5686-9f68-726c42775b69'}, {'abstract': 'A series of riveting, raw wiretapped conversations were used to show what was going on behind the scenes as Dean G. Skelos voted on legislation that the government has said would benefit his son.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/19/nyregion/tapes-played-at-skelos-corruption-trial-portray-strategy-used-against-democrats.html', 'snippet': 'A series of riveting, raw wiretapped conversations were used to show what was going on behind the scenes as Dean G. Skelos voted on legislation that the government has said would benefit his son.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jurors at the federal corruption trial of the former State Senate majority leader, Dean G. Skelos, and his son listened on Wednesday to a series of riveting, raw and sometimes bizarre wiretapped conversations. Prosecutors played them as part of an effort to show what was going on behind the scenes as the senator voted on legislation and took other actions that the government has said would benefit his son, a situation most of his fellow legislators were not aware of.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 