ing house.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/19/opinion/sleazy-business-as-usual-in-albany.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Andrew Cuomo should call a special legislative session devoted to cleaning house.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The separate federal trials this month of the former Assembly speaker, Sheldon Silver, and Dean Skelos, former leader of the State Senate, are about the same thing: public corruption at the highest levels of New York State government. Both men were bounced from their leadership jobs and both now confront multiple charges of kickbacks, bribery and extortion, all carefully hidden in secret documents and phone calls.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sleazy Business as Usual in Albany', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sleazy Business as Usual in Albany', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Silver, Sheldon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Skelos, Dean G', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Skelos, Adam B (1982- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-19T08:21:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/94d646b3-2e1d-523f-82a7-705047af3c46', 'word_count': 665, 'uri': 'ny