europe/paris-attacks.html', 'snippet': 'Abdelhamid Abaaoud is believed to have organized a string of attacks that made him the most talked-about — and, in jihadist circles, feted — terrorist since Osama bin Laden.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VERVIERS, Belgium — Black smudges and faded traces of gunfire on a red brick rowhouse here in eastern Belgium mark the death foretold of Abdelhamid Abaaoud. It is the spot where, 11 months before the announcement on Thursday that he had been killed outside Paris, he began plotting an elaborate campaign of terror across Europe.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris Attacks Suspect Killed in Shootout Had Plotted Terror for 11 Months', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Paris Suspect Drafted an Elaborate Plot of Terror Across Europe ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'De Freytas-Tamura, Kimiko', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Attacks (November 2015)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Higgins, Andrew', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abaaoud, Abdelhamid', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belgium', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-19T10:28:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Higgins and Kimiko de Freytas-Tamura', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Higgins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Kimiko', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'de Freytas-Tamura', 'qualif