ce members with his height and balance, and watch the ‘‘educated’’ horses ridden two at a time by one man. You could see Barretta, the Boneless Wonder, whom, years before, a young Winston Churchill had begged in vain to see. (According to Boris Johnson’s biography, ‘‘The Churchill Factor,’’ his parents decided the sight would be ‘‘too demoralizing and revolting’’ for a child.)', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '48', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/magazine/22circus-slide-8M3R/22circus-slide-8M3R-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/22/magazine/22circus-slide-8M3R/22circus-slide-8M3R-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/magazine/22circus-slide-8M3R/22circus-slide-8M3R-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/magazine/22circus-slide-8M3R/22circus-slide-8M3R-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1326, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/magazine/22circus-slide-8M3R/22circus-slide-8M3R-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/22/magazine/22circus-slide-8M3R/22circus-slide-8M3R-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/magazine/22circus-slide-8M3R/22circus-slide-8M3R-thumb