ents’ best interests.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/19/a-new-threat-to-your-retirement/', 'snippet': 'Proposed legislation could derail a rule requiring retirement advisers to act in their clients’ best interests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In April, the Labor Department proposed an important rule designed\xa0to protect Americans’ retirement savings\xa0by requiring\xa0advisers to act in their clients’\xa0best interests — and not their own. As things stand now, brokers, insurance agents and other salespeople\xa0— who often call themselves “consultants” or “advisers” —\xa0are allowed to steer clients into high-priced products and strategies when comparable and cheaper ones are available.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/opinion/18tritchWEB/18tritchWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 472, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/19/opinion/18tritchWEB/18tritchWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 472}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/opinion/18tritchWEB/18tritchWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 805, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/opinion/18tritchWEB/18tritchWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1289, 'width': 1640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/opinion/18tritchWEB/18tritchWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/19/opinion/18tritchWEB/18tritchWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75,