', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/08e72ba9-2660-548a-b80f-66119767ff2c', 'word_count': 253, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08e72ba9-2660-548a-b80f-66119767ff2c'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Greene, a Silicon Valley veteran, has been a board member of Google and founded Bebop Technologies, which Google has agreed to buy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/20/technology/google-picks-diane-greene-to-expand-its-cloud-business.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Greene, a Silicon Valley veteran, has been a board member of Google and founded Bebop Technologies, which Google has agreed to buy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Google is playing catch-up in the booming cloud computing market, well behind the early leader, Amazon. But on Thursday, Google made clear that it was ready to go on the offensive.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Google Picks Diane Greene to Expand Its Cloud Business', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Director at Google Will Lead Cloud Effort', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lohr, Steve', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greene, Diane B', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cloud Computing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Alphabet Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'VMware Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'EMC Corporation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bebop Technologies', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosenblum, Mendel', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-19T21:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Lohr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lohr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c1dfd08-fbc6-5c38-abdf-ee447a0daffd', 'word_count': 1002, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c1dfd08-fbc6-5c38-abdf-ee447a0daffd'}, {'abstract': 'Times critics share what they’ve been listening to lately.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/19/classical-playlist-villegas-praetorius-and-boulezs-mozart/', 'snippet': 'Times critics share what they’ve been listening to lately.', 'lead_paragraph': '‘Americano’Pablo Villegas, guitar(Harmonia Mundi)This charismatic Spanish guitarist offers repertory from the Americas, including works by Villa-Lobos, Augustín Lara, John Williams, Bernstein (excerpts from “West Side Story”) and lesser-known composers including Luiz Bonfá. Throughout, Mr. Villegas’s virtuosic playing is characterized by its vividly shaded colors and his irresistible exuberance, contrasted with the intimacy he conveys in the more introverted sections. The disc concludes with some foot-tapping bluegrass selections, performed with the guitarist James Chirillo. (Vivien Schweitzer)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Classical Playlist: Villegas, Praetorius, and Boulez’s Mozart', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boulez, Pierre', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tetzlaff, Christian', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ECM (Record Label)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {