5'}, {'abstract': 'Concerns that a catastrophic event at the hands of terrorists could strike the city were revived by the terrorism in France.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/22/nyregion/after-paris-attacks-anxiety-returns-to-the-surface-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Concerns that a catastrophic event at the hands of terrorists could strike the city were revived by the terrorism in France.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a June night in 1919, followers of the anarchist Luigi Galleani set off bombs in New York, Boston, Pittsburgh and other major United States cities in a series of coordinated attacks directed at prominent civic figures, some of whom had supported the deportation of immigrants suspected of engaging in illegal activity.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/nyregion/22BIG/22BIG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/22/nyregion/22BIG/22BIG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/nyregion/22BIG/22BIG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/nyregion/22BIG/22BIG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1493, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/nyregion/22BIG/22BIG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/22/nyregion/22BIG/22BIG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailw