rranea-african-migrants-perilous-trek-to-a-hostile-land.html', 'snippet': 'Risking everything to seek a better life in Europe, two close friends leave West Africa to settle in Italy in Jonas Carpignano’s first feature film.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Mediterranea” is one of the earliest in what is almost certain to be a deluge of films about 21st-century migrants risking everything to seek a better life in Europe. The first feature film directed and written by Jonas Carpignano, it follows the harrowing odyssey of two close friends from Burkina Faso in West Africa who cross the Mediterranean to settle in Italy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/20/arts/20MEDITERRNEASUB/20MEDITERRNEASUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/20/arts/20MEDITERRNEASUB/20MEDITERRNEASUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/20/arts/20MEDITERRNEASUB/20MEDITERRNEASUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/20/arts/20MEDITERRNEASUB/20MEDITERRNEASUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1777, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/20/arts/20MEDITERRNEASUB/20MEDITERRNEASUB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/20/arts/20MEDITERRNEASUB/20MEDITERRNEASUB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheigh