ract': 'The political struggle over new restrictions on refugees from Syria and Iraq moves to the Senate after bipartisan House approval on Thursday. But there won’t be any action until the week after Thanksgiving at the earliest, and Senate Democrats see that as a welcome cooling-off period.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/11/20/senate-democrats-hope-thanksgiving-offers-clarity-on-refugee-bill/', 'snippet': 'The political struggle over new restrictions on refugees from Syria and Iraq moves to the Senate after bipartisan House approval on Thursday. But there won’t be any action until the week after Thanksgiving at the earliest, and Senate Democrats see...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The political struggle over new restrictions on refugees from Syria and Iraq now moves to the Senate after easy bipartisan approval in the House on Thursday. But there won’t be any action until the week after Thanksgiving at the earliest, and Senate Democrats see that as good news for them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/us/19firstdraftnl-obama/19firstdraftnl-obama-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/19/us/19firstdraftnl-obama/19firstdraftnl-obama-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/us/19firstdraftnl-obama/19firstdraftnl-obama-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/19/us/19firstdraftnl-obama/19firstdraftnl-obama-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subty