“Time Out for Ginger.” Brooks Atkinson called her characterization “bubbly and enchanting.” At the last performance, as she made her final exit, the veteran actor Melvyn Douglas closed the door behind her and ad-libbed, “She’s going to be a great actress, that kid.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/arts/22LOIS1/22LOIS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/22/arts/22LOIS1/22LOIS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/arts/22LOIS1/22LOIS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/arts/22LOIS1/22LOIS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/arts/22LOIS1/22LOIS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/22/arts/22LOIS1/22LOIS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/arts/22LOIS1/22LOIS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lois Smith’s Year of Working Constantly', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Year of Working Constantly', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'key