ortant museums and stole 17 paintings, including works by Mantegna and Rubens, and five pieces by Jacopo Tintoretto. The museum estimated the total value at between $10.7 million and $16 million.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Thieves Steal 17 Artworks From Verona Museum', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Theft of Paintings in Italy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubens, Peter Paul', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Verona (Italy)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-20T17:43:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/262b92c7-63b1-508b-ac55-e922bbec3237', 'word_count': 130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/262b92c7-63b1-508b-ac55-e922bbec3237'}, {'abstract': 'CNN said that Republican candidates will need to have either a national polling average of 3.5 percent or higher, or be polling at 4 percent or higher in Iowa or New Hampshire, to qualify for the prime-time debate, which will be held in Las Vegas on Dec. 15.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/11/20/cnn-sets-polling-requirements-to-make-main-stage-at-next-g-o-p-debate/', 'snippet': 'CNN said that Republican candidates will need to have either a national polling average of 3.5 percent or higher, or be polling at 4 percent or higher in Iowa or New Hampshire, to qualify for the prime-time debate, which will be held in Las Vegas ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'CNN is broadening its criteria for next month’s Republican presidential debate, including polling from Iowa and New Hampshire to determine which candidates make the main stage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/20/us/20firstdraft-cnn/20firstdraft-cnn-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/20/us/20firstdraft-cnn/20firstdraft-cnn-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/20/us/20firstdraft-cnn/20firstdraft-cnn-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/20/us/20firstdraft-cnn/20firstdraft-cnn-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/20/us/20firstdraft-cnn/20firstdraft-cnn-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/20/us/20firstdraft-cnn/20firstdraft-cnn-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/20/us/20firstdraft-cnn/20firstdraft-cnn-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'CNN Sets Polling Requirements to Make Main Stage at Next G.O.P. Debate', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Politic