 its first national championship since 1958.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/21/sports/ncaafootball/iowa-coach-kirk-ferentz-guides-undefeated-hawkeyes-to-unfamiliar-heights.html', 'snippet': 'Ferentz, whose job may have been in jeopardy after last season, has Iowa in a position to make a run at its first national championship since 1958.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IOWA CITY — In the early 1970s, amid the Iowa football team’s 19-year streak without a winning season, the former University of Iowa president Willard Boyd arrived early to a Big Ten meeting and made small talk with his friend Novice Fawcett, the president of Ohio State.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/sports/21IOWAweb1/21IOWAweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/21/sports/21IOWAweb1/21IOWAweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/sports/21IOWAweb1/21IOWAweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 653, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/sports/21IOWAweb1/21IOWAweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1305, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/sports/21IOWAweb1/21IOWAweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/21/sports/21IOWAweb1/21IOWAweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/sports/21IOWAweb1/21IOWAweb1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Iowa Coach Kirk Ferentz Guides Undefeated Hawkeyes to Unfamiliar Heights', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Years of Patience, Unfamiliar Heights', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tracy, Marc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferentz, Kirk (1955- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coaches and Managers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Iowa', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-20T19:44:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marc Tracy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marc', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tracy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf6471f8-594f-5bdf-b97a-225a9241b98b', 'word_count': 1215, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf6471f8-594f-5bdf-b97a-225a9241b98b'}, {'abstract': 'The artist’s “Sisyphus, Sissy Fuss, Silly Puss” depicts his partner, Jade Berreau, and daughter, Secret, exploring nature in upstate New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/20/t-magazine/dash-snow-video-brant-foundation.html', 'snippet': 'The artist’s “Sisyphus, Sissy Fuss, Silly Puss” depicts his partner, Jade Berreau, and daughter, Secret, exploring nature in upstate New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The exhibition “Dash Snow: Freeze Means Run,” on view now at the Brant Foundation Art Study Center in Greenwich, Conn., was conceived as a labor of love. The career-spanning retrospective was organized in part by three of the late artist’s best friends: Dan Colen, Hanna Liden and Nate Lowman. Their mission to honor the memory of their comrade and (sometimes literal) partner in crime is evident throughout the show, which comprises many of the artist’s best known and most controversial works — including the front pages of newspapers he infamously decorated with his own bodily fluid — but which is more striking in its inclusion of more personal work from Snow. Among the more than 100 previously unexhibited Polaroids on display are many that depict Snow and his friends drinking and drugging, or in lithe, louche repose — windows on a moment in time that seems, in retrospect, inevitably brief.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Tender, Intimate Video by Dash Snow', 'kicker': 'Art', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snow, Dash', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greenwich (Conn)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-20T19:47:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandria Symonds', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandria', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Symonds', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6859d1b-8174-56b7-8421-dce3a48aaaef', 'word_count': 384, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6859d1b-8174-56b7-8421-dce3a48aaaef'}, {'abstract': 'Three graceful ways to prepare the remains of your holiday feast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/25/dining/thanksgiving-leftovers-recipes.html', 'snippet': 'Three graceful ways to prepare the remains of your holiday feast.', 'lead_pa