 I missed the memo — when did everyone move to Brooklyn?”', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daisy Prince on Her Greenwich Village Apartment', 'kicker': 'What I Love', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mother, Mother on the Wall ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prince, Cynthia E (Daisy) (1975- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greenwich Village (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington Square Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-20T22:07:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Shaw', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shaw', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/998ecaec-1de5-5b36-9020-95b83be978b2', 'word_count': 931, 'uri': 'nyt://article/998ecaec-1de5-5b36-9020-95b83be978b2'}, {'abstract': 'Daisy Prince, the editor of Avenue magazine, which just published its 40th anniversary issue, lives in Greenwich Village with her family.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/11/22/realestate/what-i-love-daisy-prince.html', 'snippet': 'Daisy Prince, the editor of Avenue magazine, which just published its 40th anniversary issue, lives in Greenwich Village with her family.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Daisy Prince, the editor of Avenue magazine, which just published its 40th anniversary issue, lives in Greenwich Village with her family.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype'