e75509ea944e', 'word_count': 700, 'uri': 'nyt://article/240c406d-a287-524d-ae1b-e75509ea944e'}, {'abstract': 'In America’s heartland, farmers are taking steps to help the environment and return carbon to the soil.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/21/opinion/iowas-climate-change-wisdom.html', 'snippet': 'In America’s heartland, farmers are taking steps to help the environment and return carbon to the soil.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Iowa City — NEGOTIATORS en route to the United Nations conference on climate change in Paris, scheduled to begin later this month, should take a detour on rural roads here in Johnson County. A new climate narrative is emerging among farmers in the American heartland that transcends a lot of the old story lines of denial and cynicism, and offers an updated tale of climate hope.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/opinion/21biggers/21biggers-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/21/opinion/21biggers/21biggers-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/opinion/21biggers/21biggers-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/opinion/21biggers/21biggers-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1436, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/opinion/21biggers/21biggers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumb