ss/hyundai-cars-are-recalled-over-faulty-brake-switch.html', 'snippet': 'The automaker is recalling more than 300,000 2011-12 Sonatas because the transmission can be moved out of park without pressing the brake pedal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hyundai is recalling about 305,000 of its 2011-12 Sonata models because the automatic transmission could possibly be moved out of park without pressing the brake pedal, allowing the car to roll or drive away, according to a report from the automaker posted this week on the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration’s website.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hyundai Cars Are Recalled Over Faulty Brake Switch', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hyundai Cars Are Recalled to Repair Brake Switch', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hyundai Motor Co', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jensen, Christopher', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recalls and Bans of Products', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Safety Features and Defects', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Highway Traffic Safety Administration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-21T16:21:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1c235ee-5a95-57d5-a584-f77da320cc85', 'word_count': 227, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1c235ee-5a95-57d5-a584-f77da320cc85'}, {'abstract': 'Penn students’ tradition of throwing toast can be traced to an alcohol ban in the 1970s, and it appears to be linked to a scene in “The Rocky Horror Picture Show.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/22/sports/ncaafootball/a-cherished-custom-at-penn-any-way-you-slice-it.html', 'snippet': 'Penn students’ tradition of throwing toast can be traced to an alcohol ban in the 1970s, and it appears to be linked to a scene in “The Rocky Horror Picture Show.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'University of Pennsylvania fans have a peculiar way of displaying school spirit at home games. They throw toast.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/sports/DOG-campus1/DOG-campus1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/22/sports/DOG-campus1/DOG-campus1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/sports/DOG-campus1/DOG-campus1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/sports/DOG-campus1/DOG-campus1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/sports/DOG-campus1/DOG-campus1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/22/sports/DOG-campus1/DOG-campus1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i