Hotel in Bamako was carried out by a jihadist group loyal to Mokhtar Belmokhtar, a Qaeda operative.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A member of Al Qaeda in Africa confirmed Saturday that the attack Friday on a hotel in Bamako, Mali, had been carried out by a jihadist group loyal to Mokhtar Belmokhtar, an Algerian operative for Al Qaeda.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mali Hotel Attackers Are Tied to an Algerian Qaeda Leader', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Attackers at Hotel Are Linked to an Algerian Qaeda Leader', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belmokhtar, Mokhtar', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mali', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Radisson Blu Hotel (Bamako, Mali, Hotel)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bamako (Mali)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-21T17:04:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rukmini Callimachi and Nabih Bulos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rukmini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Callimachi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nabih', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bulos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/860531f3-2ff9-5ff1-8678-34c1132fa4a3', 'word_count': 939, 'uri': 'nyt://article/860531f3-2ff9-5ff1-8678-34c1132fa4a3'}, {'abstract': 'The Pentagon has seized a trove of emails and documents as it widens an investigation into Central Command over accusations that officials had overstated the progress of airstrikes against the Islamic State.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/22/us/politics/military-reviews-us-response-to-isis-rise.html', 'snippet': 'The Pentagon has seized a trove of emails and documents as it widens an investigation into Central Command over accusations that officials had overstated the progress of airstrikes against the Islamic State.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — When Islamic State fighters overran a string of Iraqi cities last year, analysts at United States Central Command wrote classified assessments for military intelligence officials and policy makers that documented the humiliating retreat of the Iraqi Army. But before the assessments were final, former intelligence officials said, the analysts’ superiors made significant changes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/world/22CENTCOM1/22CENTCOM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/22/world/22CENTCOM1/22CENTCOM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/world/22CENTCOM1/22CENTCOM1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/world/22CENTCOM1/22CENTCOM1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1303, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/world/22CENTCOM1/22CENTCOM1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/22/world/22CENTCOM1/22CENTCOM1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/world/22CENTCOM1/22CENTCOM1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pentagon Expands Inquiry Into Intelligence on ISIS Surge', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inquiry Grows Into Intelligence on ISIS Surge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmidt, Michael S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mazzetti, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Iraqi Army', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Central Command', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-21T17:17:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Apuzzo, Mark Mazzetti and Michael S. Schmidt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Apuzzo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mazzetti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Schmidt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ff554f30-2c26-52c6-aae3-05636585c594', 'word_count': 1178, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ff554f30-2c26-52c6-aae3-05636585c594'}, {'abstract': 'Some employees are what researchers call “de-energizers,” spreading a dispiriting attitude around the office. In nonacademic terms, these people are known as jerks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/22/business/finding-ways-to-thwart-the-jerk-at-work.html', 'snippet': 'Some employees are what researchers call “de-energizers,” spreading a dispiriting attitude around the office. In nonacademic terms, these people are known as jerks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most of us have days at work when we walk around with a spring in our step and perform our tasks with gusto — and other days when our feet drag and we just can’t seem to get motivated. A new study encourages employees to look more closely at the people around them as one reason for that disparity.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/business/22-APPLIED/22-APPLIED-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/22/business/22-APPLIED/22-APPLIED-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 960}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/business/22-APPLIED/22-APPLIED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/22/business/22-APPLIED/22-APPLIED-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1280, 'subType': 'superJumbo',