e police video of the fatal shooting of a black 17-year-old by a white police officer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — For months, leaders here watched as other cities faced angry demonstrations over police conduct, shootings and relations with black people, often captured in painful videos. As cities like Ferguson, Mo., Baltimore and New York have been consumed by fatal encounters involving the local police that have fueled national attention since 2014, this city managed to keep a lower profile. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chicago Set for Protests Over Shooting by the Police', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chicago Set for Protests Over Shooting by the Police', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McDonald, Laquan (d 2014)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Emanuel, Rahm', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (Chicago, Ill)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-21T23:15:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Monica Davey and Mitch Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Monica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Davey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank'