aulay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/b62af8cb-2e69-5328-af54-644b6505cdbf', 'word_count': 581, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b62af8cb-2e69-5328-af54-644b6505cdbf'}, {'abstract': 'The pianist Jeremy Denk, an Ives champion, and the violinist Stefan Jackiw gave arresting accounts of four astonishing pieces at the 92nd Street Y.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/arts/music/review-jeremy-denk-and-stefan-jackiws-lessons-in-ivessnostalgic-sonatas.html', 'snippet': 'The pianist Jeremy Denk, an Ives champion, and the violinist Stefan Jackiw gave arresting accounts of four astonishing pieces at the 92nd Street Y.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A concert offering all four of Charles Ives’s craggy violin sonatas might seem at first more a music history lesson than an engaging program. If not quite rarities, these fiercely original works are pretty close.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23POLYPHONY-SUB/23POLYPHONY-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23POLYPHONY-SUB/23POLYPHONY-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23POLYPHONY-SUB/23POLYPHONY-SUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23POLYPHONY-SUB/23POLYPHONY-SUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail