epal-police-deadly-protests.html', 'snippet': 'Violence flared in southern Nepal when the police opened fire on protesters from the Madhesi group who had been blocking the country’s main highway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KATHMANDU, Nepal — Violence flared in southern Nepal when the police open fire on protesters who had been blocking the country’s main highway, an official said on Sunday. The shootings threatened to deepen a political crisis over the country’s new Constitution.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nepal Police Kill 3 Protesters in Clashes Over Constitution', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Constitutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nepal', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ban Ki-moon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-22T22:50:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bhadra Sharma', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bhadra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sharma', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b58529d-ff58-5658-b7a9-a93d215e4b8d', 'word_count': 510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b58529d-ff58-5658-b7a9-a93d215e4b8d'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Rattle and his orchestra performed the nine symphonies over five nights at Carnegie Hall. The cycle has become a summit to be climbed over and over and over again.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/arts/music/review-a-beethoven-cycle-from-simon-rattle-and-the-berlin-philharmonic.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Rattle and his orchestra performed the nine symphonies over five nights at Carnegie Hall. The cycle has become a summit to be climbed over and over and over again.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Claudio Abbado. Herbert von Karajan. Wilhelm Furtwängler. You are weighed upon golden scales, if you are the chief conductor of the Berlin Philharmonic. And for good or ill, the balance tilts hardest in what is still thought of as classical music’s core repertoire: Mahler, nowadays; Brahms, naturally; Beethoven, forever.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23PHILHARMONIKER1/23PHILHARMONIKER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23PHILHARMONIKER1/23PHILHARMONIKER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23PHILHARMONIKER1/23PHILHARMONIKER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 566, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23PHILHARMONIKER1/23PHILHARMONIKER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1132, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23PHILHARMONIKER1/23PHILHARMONIKER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/23/arts/23PHILHARMONIKER1/23PHILHARMONIKER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidt