ence', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Thanksgiving Day', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-22T23:26:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Heffernan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heffernan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b657f848-3b67-56e5-9318-aa0a9f6c3969', 'word_count': 1403, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b657f848-3b67-56e5-9318-aa0a9f6c3969'}, {'abstract': 'Both groups said that the United Nations health agency’s outbreak and emergency response capacities should be strengthened, and protected from political meddling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/world/africa/united-nations-who-emergency-preparedness-ebola.html', 'snippet': 'Both groups said that the United Nations health agency’s outbreak and emergency response capacities should be strengthened, and protected from political meddling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In recent months, numerous groups of health experts have gathered to debate how to prevent another crisis like the Ebola epidemic in West Africa, which jumped borders, spread fear across the globe, and directly killed more than 11,000 people. Many more died as hospitals and clinics closed for months.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Panels Advise Bolstering W.H.O. for Crises Like Ebola', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Panels Advise Bolstering W.H.O. for Crises Like Ebola ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fink, Sheri', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '