times.com/2015/11/23/word-of-the-day-quiz-bludgeon/', 'snippet': 'This word has appeared in 30 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'bludgeon • \\ˈblə-jən\\• noun and verb', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Word of the Day + Quiz | bludgeon', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-11-23T05:02:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ffca7a1-c325-5d86-a1b2-9badc89c1099', 'word_count': 233, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ffca7a1-c325-5d86-a1b2-9badc89c1099'}, {'abstract': 'The top performers and key injuries in the league this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/sports/football/the-best-of-week-11-in-the-nfl.html', 'snippet': 'The top performers and key injuries in the league this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jameis Winston threw five touchdown passes in the Buccaneers’ rout of the Eagles, tying the N.F.L. rookie record for the most in a game. Winston, who completed 19 of 29 passes for 246 yards over all, had four touchdown throws in the first half, to four receivers. He tied Matthew Stafford’s rookie mark from 2009 in the third quarter on an 8-yard pass to Cameron Brate, the fifth Tampa Bay receiver with a scoring catch on Sunday. Entering the day, Winston had not thrown for more than two touchdowns in a game.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/sports/23BEST/23BEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/23/sports/23BEST/23BEST-arti