 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a12967c0-3993-5829-ab93-5f49b0bc539b', 'word_count': 281, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a12967c0-3993-5829-ab93-5f49b0bc539b'}, {'abstract': 'Dave Roberts, whose parents are African-American and Japanese, is the Dodgers’ first minority manager and the third in baseball', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/sports/baseball/after-deliberate-search-dodgers-are-said-to-be-hiring-dave-roberts-as-their-manager.html', 'snippet': 'Dave Roberts, whose parents are African-American and Japanese, is the Dodgers’ first minority manager and the third in baseball', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Dodgers are expected to announce Monday that they have filled the last opening for a manager in the major leagues with the hiring of Dave Roberts, according to multiple media reports. Roberts, 43, whose parents are African-American and Japanese would be the Dodgers’ first minority manager and the third in baseball, along with Fredi Gonzalez of the Atlanta Braves and Dusty Baker, recently hired by the Washington Nationals.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/sports/23DODGERS/23DODGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/23/sports/23DODGERS/23DODGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 668}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/sports/23DODGERS/23DODGERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 920, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/sports/23DODGERS/23DODGERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1730, 'width': 1553, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'cro