deo captured him shooting Peter Gold, 25, in the stomach.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/us/new-orleans-shooting-suspect-euric-cain-tulane-medical-student-peter-gold.html', 'snippet': 'The authorities said they were searching for Euric Cain, 21, after surveillance video captured him shooting Peter Gold, 25, in the stomach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New Orleans police identified a suspect on Sunday in the shooting of a Tulane University medical student who had tried to help a woman being dragged down a sidewalk toward a vehicle in the pre-dawn hours on Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/23samaritan/23samaritan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 384, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/23samaritan/23samaritan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 384, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/23samaritan/23samaritan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/23/us/23samaritan/23samaritan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/23samaritan/23samaritan-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Police Name Suspect in Shooting of New Orleans Medical Student', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tulane Unive