or Nixdorf in Europe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Diebold, the American maker of automated teller machines and financial software, said on Monday that it had agreed to acquire Wincor Nixdorf, a German provider of information technology services to the financial industry and retailers, in a cash-and-share deal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Diebold to Acquire Wincor Nixdorf for $1.8 Billion, Including Debt', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Diebold Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ohio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-23T12:08:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/17ed2c5c-870f-5648-8db6-ff902cb9b977', 'word_count': 365, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17ed2c5c-870f-5648-8db6-ff902cb9b977'}, {'abstract': 'The landslide, at a mine in Kachin State, highlighted the primitive conditions of an industry that is highly lucrative but notorious for its secrecy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/world/asia/myanmar-landslide-jade-mine.html', 'snippet': 'The landslide, at a mine in Kachin State, highlighted the primitive conditions of an industry that is highly lucrative but notorious for its secrecy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BANGKOK — It was known locally as Plastic Village, a sprawling encampment made from tarps and scraps of trash and inhabited by workers who scavenged for jade in the rugged hills of northern Myanmar.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Myanmar Continues Search After Deadly Landslide at Jade Mine', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Myanmar Continues Search After Fatal Jade Mine Landslide ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Myanmar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fuller, Thomas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Landslides and Mudslides', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jade', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kachin State (Myanmar)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rescues', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-23T12:16:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Fuller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fuller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf1a54f3-894f-51ee-a27b-2c5d75140e9a', 'word_count': 813, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf1a54f3-894f-51ee-a27b-2c5d75140e9a'}, {'abstract': 'The agreement would be the latest, and largest, aimed at helping an American company lower its taxes by reincorporating overseas, a tactic known as corporate inversion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/business/dealbook/pfizer-allergan-merger-inversion.html', 'snippet': 'The agreement would be the latest, and largest, aimed at helping an American company lower its taxes by reincorporati