Schillinger, Liesl', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hanukkah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holidays and Special Occasions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-23T15:40:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liesl Schillinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liesl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schillinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68d42c10-e4a7-5290-bda4-e4db90fbad08', 'word_count': 584, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68d42c10-e4a7-5290-bda4-e4db90fbad08'}, {'abstract': 'Supporters of Ben Carson made a fund-raising plea that they hope will reinvigorate his campaign. A new media team is also trying to showcase a different side of the retired neurosurgeon through interviews with his former patients.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/11/23/ben-carson-supporters-cite-vulgar-attacks-in-seeking-donations/', 'snippet': 'Supporters of Ben Carson made a fund-raising plea that they hope will reinvigorate his campaign. A new media team is also trying to showcase a different side of the retired neurosurgeon through interviews with his former patients.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Supporters of Ben Carson, with his strength in the polls showing signs of fading, lashed out at critics and the national media in a fund-raising plea on Monday that they hope will reinvigorate his campaign.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/23firstdraft-carson/23firstdraft-carson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/23/us/23firstdraft-carson/23firstdraft-carson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth':