ival of late autumn here signals the season of the olive harvest, as it has since the 1300s, when the city’s noble families first built vacation homes with farms and groves on the fertile slopes of the province, supplying their households with olive oil, wine and firewood throughout the year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Corner of Tuscany Where Olive Oil Is a Deeper Green', 'kicker': 'Making It', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olive Oil', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tuscany (Italy)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lucca (Italy)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-23T18:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura Rysman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rysman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f217b9c8-d109-5365-b54a-d0ecd719c54e', 'word_count': 578, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f217b9c8-d109-5365-b54a-d0ecd719c54e'}, {'abstract': 'The musical comedy finally arrived on Broadway nearly 50 years after it debuted Off Off Broadway.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/dames-at-sea-will-close-on-broadway/', 'snippet': 'The musical comedy finally arrived on Broadway nearly 50 years after it debuted Off Off Broadway.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Dames at Sea,” which in October finally got its Broadway premiere nearly 50 years after its original Off Off Broadway production, will take its final bow at the Helen Hayes Theater on Jan. 3. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url