n news reports quoting a government statement..', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/world/europe/russia-says-it-killed-14-isis-recruiters-in-north-caucasus.html', 'snippet': 'The men, accused of smuggling out fighters to join the Islamic State, were killed in two clashes with law enforcement agents, according to Russian news reports quoting a government statement..', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Russian security services killed 14 insurgents who were smuggling fighters out of the North Caucasus region to join the Islamic State in Syria, Russian news reports said Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia Says It Killed 14 ISIS Recruiters in North Caucasus', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Briefing | Europe; Russia: Security Services Kill 14 Linked to Smuggling of Fighters to Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Caucasus (Russia)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-23T21:36:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil MacFarquhar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacFarquhar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/46b2ac65-1f1f-55e7-aa65-6d150a94dc1d', 'word_count': 308, 'uri': 'nyt://article/46b2ac65-1f1f-55e7-aa65-6d150a94dc1d'}, {'abstract': 'Lady Gaga, Rita Ora, Victoria Beckham and more at the British Fashion Awards on Monday in London.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/fashion/british-fashion-awards-red-carpet.html', 'snippet': 'Lady Gaga, Rita Ora, Victoria Beckham and more at the British Fashion Awards on Monday in London.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Monday night’s British Fashion Awards, more than 800 fashion insiders voted for the 16 winners in categories representing women’s wear, men’s wear, red carpet design, model of the year and more. This year the ceremony will also honor Karl Lagerfeld with an Outstanding Achievement award and Alessandro Michele of Gucci with an International Designer award, as well as provide stellar red-carpet moments from guests like Lady Gaga, Kate Bosworth and more.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British Fashion Awards Red Carpet', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-23T21:37:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/530ee7bd-2fb4-523e-881d-09fdb586415d', 'word_count': 72, 'uri': 'nyt://article/530ee7bd-2fb4-523e-881d-09fdb586415d'}, {'abstract': 'The reporter Liz Robbins describes her afternoon visit with a Syrian family newly arrived in New Haven.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/insider/reporters-notebook-syrian-refugees-rejected-rerouted-and-resettled.html', 'snippet': 'The reporter Liz Robbins describes her afternoon visit with a Syrian family newly arrived in New Haven.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They moved from street to street in Syria, dodging bullets and bombs. Finally, they fled to Jordan, where they lived an anxious existence as unwelcome refugees. And then, after three years of interviews and security checks, a Syrian family — a 33-year-old man, his 23-year-old wife and their almost 5-year-old son — were granted refugee status in the United States.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/insider/25-insider-refugee-button-image/25-insider-refugee-button-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/insider/25-insider-refugee-button-image/25-insider-refugee-button-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/insider/25-insider-refugee-button-image/25-insider-refugee-button-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/25/insider/25-insider-refugee-button-image/25-insider-refugee-button-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/insider/25-insider-refugee-button-image/25-insider-refugee-button-image-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Syrian Refugees Rejected, Rerouted and Resettled', 'kicker': 'Reporter’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'su