nt_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charles Isherwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charles', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Isherwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b0f4317-20cc-5815-97f2-f2541dade040', 'word_count': 938, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b0f4317-20cc-5815-97f2-f2541dade040'}, {'abstract': 'Gary Cee will make you tumble to his theme.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/23/washer-action/', 'snippet': 'Gary Cee will make you tumble to his theme.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUESDAY PUZZLE — There comes a time in every homeowner’s life when it becomes necessary to make a sacrifice to the god of home appliances in the form of large amounts of money. I encountered that moment shortly after moving into my current house, when I tried to track down the mysterious sounds emanating from my basement, only to discover my washing machine performing a conga across the floor in mid-SPIN CYCLE.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Washer Action', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-24T03:00:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6f6a6b4-a14d-55c8-a905-cead0214b043', 'word_count': 665, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6f6a6b4-a14d-55c8-a905-cead0214b043'}, {'abstract': 'Kristaps Porzingis was productive once again, collecting 20 points and 14 rebounds. But he worked for everything, shooting 7 of 18 from the field against waves of defenders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/sports/basketball/heat-pressure-kristaps-porzingis-and-beat-knicks.html', 'snippet': 'Kristaps Porzingis was productive once again, collecting 20 points and 14 rebounds. But he worked for everything, shooting 7 of 18 from the field against waves of defenders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — Heat players pledged before Monday’s game to learn from the mistakes of their predecessors. They would actually defend Kristaps Porzingis, the newly minted wunderkind of the Knicks. They would roam with him to the perimeter, denying him open looks at 3-pointers. They would challenge him.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/24/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/24/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/24/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/24/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/24/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/24/sports/CITY-KNICKS