ilable to rein in the next outbreak.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/after-the-crisis-tools-for-limiting-ebola/', 'snippet': 'Under the pressure of spreading calamity, vaccines were readied to stem the Ebola epidemic even as it sputtered out. Now they’re available to rein in the next outbreak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ebola lingers. A 15-year-old boy in Monrovia, Liberia, his father and his brother are sick with the disease, the first cases in Liberia since June. How the boy caught Ebola is a mystery, but it is likely he had contact with an Ebola survivor. The virus also lingers in the body — and can sicken its host and infect others —\xa0even months after recovery.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-fixes/opinionator-pog-fixes-articleLarge.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-fixes/opinionator-pog-fixes-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-fixes/opinionator-pog-fixes-jumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-fixes/opinionator-pog-fixes-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-fixes/opinionator-pog-fixes-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'ima