at something is different.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/photographing-soldiers-back-from-war/', 'snippet': 'The photographs are riveting; only upon second glance do you realize that something is different.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The photographs are riveting: Scantily clad men with impossibly chiseled torsos, stomachs rippling, biceps bulging. Only upon second glance do you realize that something is different, that these are not your basic beefcake shots. Some of the men are missing an arm, or a hand, or a leg. Others have hooks or metal rods where their limbs should be.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photographing Veterans Back From War', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001-14)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AMPUTATION', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-24T11:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Abby Ellin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Abby', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ellin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10ca2110-875f-5c54-8d8d-57d6552b094b', 'word_count': 808, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10ca2110-875f-5c54-8d8d-57d6552b094b'}, {'abstract': 'Tuesday: At the zoo, chilly weather, and poetic geese.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/nyregion/new-york-today-welcome-to-the-jungle.html', 'snippet': 'Tuesday: At the zoo, chilly weather, and poetic geese.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated 9:16 am.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank