hat he wanted Europe to increase its efforts to combat the terrorist group.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/25/world/middleeast/hollande-obama-islamic-state-paris-attacks.html', 'snippet': 'The president offered his visiting French counterpart words of solidarity on Tuesday but made it clear that he wanted Europe to increase its efforts to combat the terrorist group.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama offered his visiting French counterpart emotional words of solidarity on Tuesday but made it clear that it was up to Europe to escalate its efforts to combat the terrorist group that killed 130 people in Paris this month.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/world/25Prexy-web/25Prexy-web-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/25/world/25Prexy-web/25Prexy-web-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/world/25Prexy-web/25Prexy-web-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/world/25Prexy-web/25Prexy-web-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/world/25Prexy-web/25Prexy-web-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/25/world/25Prexy-web/25Prexy-web-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheig