 assigned by the Federal Aviation Administration said that nearly all recreational drones should be registered with the federal government.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/daily-report-cool-drone-is-it-registered/', 'snippet': 'A task force assigned by the Federal Aviation Administration said that nearly all recreational drones should be registered with the federal government.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In recommendations released on Monday, a task force assigned by the Federal Aviation Administration said that nearly all recreational drones should be registered with the federal government. The goal, it seems, is to help keep drone pilots honest as they take to the skies.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-superJumbo-v3.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-thumbStandard-v5.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-thumbStandard-v5.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-thumbLarge-v5.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Report: Cool Drone. Is It Registered?', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Aviation Administration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-24T14:33:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Plambeck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Plambeck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/351549be-a633-508f-ac7e-2a692fb8b1d7', 'word_count': 114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/351549be-a633-508f-ac7e-2a692fb8b1d7'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: 50,000 people attend a mass celebrated by the pope for all war victims in 1940.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/1940-a-mass-for-all-war-victims/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: 50,000 people attend a mass celebrated by the pope for all war victims in 1940.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — Fifty thousand persons packed St. Peter’s Church and Square this morning [Nov. 24] at a mass celebrated by Pope Pius XII for all the victims of the war and listened to an address by him before the altar in which he prayed to God to bring the peoples of the world to a peace based on justice and expressed his belief that the present hour was one of the gravest in human history. After rehearsing once more how, as head of the Church, he had worked long to re-establish peace among nations, Pope Pius said that although the noise of war seemed to drown his voice he turned to God for consolation.\xa0—\xa0New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, November 25, 1940', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1940: A Mass for All War Victims', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pius XII', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Vatican City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-24T14:36:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89a1031e-d4b0-56ca-9a1c-172266a8289a', 'word_count': 122, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89a1031e-d4b0-56ca-9a1c-172266a8289a'}, {'abstract': 'Rogelio keeps plugging away and Jane can’t let go.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/12/23/arts/television/jane-the-virgin-season-2-episode-7-review.html', 'snippet': 'Rogelio keeps plugging away and Jane can’t let go.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ah, it’s that familiar new-mother television plot: Jane has to find a babysitter. Not just any babysitter, but the perfect babysitter. That’s hard enough, but Jane has an additional, unconventional worry because she has no idea what Sin Rostro currently looks like and could, unknowingly, hire this evil woman to take care of her baby. “Jane the Virgin” is dramatic but, fortunately, not that dramatic. (At least not yet; who knows when and how Sin Rostro will pop back up in Jane’s life?)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/24/arts/23JANE/23JANE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/24/arts/23JANE/23JANE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/24/arts/23JANE/23JANE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/24/arts/23JANE/23JANE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/24/arts/23JANE/23JANE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/24/arts/23JANE/23JANE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/24/arts/23JANE/23JANE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Jane the Virgin’ Season 2, Episode 7: New Pants Wednesday', 'kicker': 'Jane the Virgin', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Jane the Virgin (TV Program)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '