article', 'news_desk': 'Insider', 'section_name': 'Times Insider', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hanna Ingber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ingber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6bba72d8-c9c2-5e90-8a7e-2f247b82cd30', 'word_count': 588, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6bba72d8-c9c2-5e90-8a7e-2f247b82cd30'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Sheikh Adbullah al-Sabah, the ruler of Kuwait, dies in 1965.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/1965-sheikh-abdullah-of-kuwait-dies/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Sheikh Adbullah al-Sabah, the ruler of Kuwait, dies in 1965.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KUWAIT — Sheikh Abdullah al-Sabah, 73, ruler of this major oil-producing nation and one of the world’s richest men, died today [Nov. 24] of heart failure. The crown prince, Sheikh Sabah al-Salem al-Sabah, was proclaimed the new ruler. Sheikh Abdullah had ruled Kuwait since its independence from Britain in 1961, and had been emir of the oil sheikhdom since 1950. Under his rule, the sandy little country on the east coast of Arabia acquired one of the most advanced social welfare systems in the world, and became a democracy with an elected parliament. He founded Kuwait’s first parliament and cabinet and enrolled the sheikhdom in the United Nations.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, November 25, 1965', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/blogs/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 384, 'width': 202, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/blogs/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh-superJumbo-v2.png', 'height': 384, 'width': 202, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/blogs/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/25/blogs/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/blogs/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh/25iht-oldnov25-sheikh-thumbLarge-v2.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1965: Sheikh Abdullah of Kuwait Dies', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kuwait', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-24T16:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6601b252-15c0-5adb-94c1-6a094cf3cbbe', 'word_count': 117, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6601b252-15c0-5adb-94c1-6a094cf3cbbe'}, {'abstract': 'Murder charges were filed against a white police officer in the 2014 death of a black teenager, who was shot 16 times.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/25/us/chicago-officer-charged-in-death-of-black-teenager-official-says.html', 'snippet': 'Murder charges were filed against a white police officer in the 2014 dea