count': 772, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4485757-a3ae-5578-92d8-09e443ff1127'}, {'abstract': 'The British songwriter talks about the inspiration behind “Hello,” “I Miss You” and more songs on her record-breaking new album.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/24/arts/music/adele-on-25-song-by-song.html', 'snippet': 'The British songwriter talks about the inspiration behind “Hello,” “I Miss You” and more songs on her record-breaking new album.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Adele’s “25” is easily shaping up to be the best-selling album of 2015: Billboard reports that Adele Adkins’s third album has broken the record for single-week sales set by  ‘N Sync’s “No Strings Attached” in March 2000. With at least 2,433,000 copies of the album sold in just over three days, “25” is also set to more than double the first-week sales of some of the biggest albums of the past 15 years, including Taylor Swift’s “1989,” the Beatles’ “1” and Eminem’s “The Eminem Show.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/arts/20POPCAST/20POPCAST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 358, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/21/arts/20POPCAST/20POPCAST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 358}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/arts/20POPCAST/20POPCAST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 610, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/arts/20POPCAST/20POPCAST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1220, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/21/arts/20POPCAST/20POPCAST-thumbStanda