linton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubio, Marco', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-25T08:20:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Campaign Stops', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas B. Edsall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/02719c91-5fb2-5140-b744-f16a6984c4f0', 'word_count': 1428, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02719c91-5fb2-5140-b744-f16a6984c4f0'}, {'abstract': 'As Francis begins his first-ever trip to Africa, he will face a powerful and assertive Roman Catholic Church that is wary of his message of tolerance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/25/world/africa/a-more-conservative-catholic-church-awaits-pope-francis-in-africa.html', 'snippet': 'As Francis begins his first-ever trip to Africa, he will face a powerful and assertive Roman Catholic Church that is wary of his message of tolerance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NAIROBI, Kenya — Headlines here call him the “Pope of Hope.” Because of him, Kenyans say they are more enthusiastic about going to church, praying regularly and treating others kindly. They want him to preach about corruption, living in peace and governing fairly.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/world/POPE/POPE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/25/world/POPE/POPE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/world/POPE/POPE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/world/POPE/POPE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/world/POPE/POPE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/25/world/POPE/POPE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/25/world/POPE/POPE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A More Conservative Catholic Church Awaits Pope Francis in Africa', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A More Conservative Church Awaits the Pope in Africa ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Francis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kenya', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gettleman, Jeffrey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uganda', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bangui (Central African Republic)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Divorce, Separations and Annulments', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-25T08:45:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Gettleman and Laurie Goodstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gettleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Laurie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ffc7b19-6727-5ae4-8508-0adda6c0e0b8', 'word_count': 1397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ffc7b19-6727-5ae4-8508-0adda6c0e0b8'}, {'abstract': 'When you take care of someone helpless, the constant thrum of doing often drowns out the bigger existential story.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/25/mothering-my-dying-friend/', 'snippet': 'When you take care of someone helpless, the constant thrum of doing often drowns out the bigger existential story.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a Venn diagram of tending helpless people at the extremes of life, the circle of caring for a dying person overlaps almost completely with the one for caring for a baby. Both are repetitive, intimate, often gross, sometimes funny, weirdly frantic even as they’re crushingly tedious, and a total act of devotion. In the nonoverlapping part of the end-of-life circle, there’s pain, grief, despair and a dreadful fading. There is movement not forward, toward consciousness, but backward, away from it. And for all of your endless patience there is nothing at the end. Just death, and your only job is a kind of mothering right up to the lip of the abyss.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-articleLarge.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/opinion/opinionator-theend-series-icon/opinionator-theend-series-icon-thumbLarge-v2.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mothering My Dying Friend', 'kicker': 'The End', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mothering My Dying Friend', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [