e/375a0823-5a6c-5e9b-af59-55fa388032ef'}, {'abstract': 'With his new work, Mr. O’Connor turns away from individualism to focus on the power of the crowd.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/29/arts/dance/tere-oconnor-thinks-big-with-the-goodbye-studies.html', 'snippet': 'With his new work, Mr. O’Connor turns away from individualism to focus on the power of the crowd.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For one semester a year, Tere O’Connor trades New York City for the University of Illinois, Urbana-Champaign, where he is a professor of dance. The good part is that he always returns, ready to start a new work, and this season it’s a doozy in sheer numbers alone.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29GUIDE5/29GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29GUIDE5/29GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29GUIDE5/29GUIDE5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29GUIDE5/29GUIDE5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1490, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29GUIDE5/29GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29GUIDE5/29GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', '