g', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-thumbLarge-v5.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Report: Turkey, Travel and Technology', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-25T15:11:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Plambeck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Plambeck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a7d2fe6-c3db-58ec-bf29-0554833d66b5', 'word_count': 214, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a7d2fe6-c3db-58ec-bf29-0554833d66b5'}, {'abstract': 'How to distract children on the verge of holiday meltdowns by combining the threat of facial disfigurement with the giggles of survival, in 11 easy steps.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/25/giving-thanks-for-a-proper-got-your-nose-bit/', 'snippet': 'How to distract children on the verge of holiday meltdowns by combining the threat of facial disfigurement with the giggles of survival, in 11 easy steps.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My own father never took my nose. He is a member of the Greatest Generation, which perhaps had bigger concerns (hellooo…Nazis!). From an early age, at holiday gatherings, when I saw my cousins and friends get their noses taken by their fathers, I never understood what was going on. It seemed horrific, but the kids always laughed in the end. I missed out, and today I can only think it was due to the fact that thrusting a fist in my face with a “thumb-that-seems-to-be-a-nose” sticking out between two fingers and then taunting me about it until I laughed at the incredulousness of it all possibly hit too close to home for him. War, you know.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/got-your-nose-motherlode/got-your-nose-motherlode-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/23/us/got-your-nose-motherlode/got-your-nose-motherlode-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/got-your-nose-motherlode/got-your-nose-motherlode-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 896, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/got-your-nose-motherlode/got-your-nose-motherlode-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 896, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/got-your-nose-motherlode/got-your-nose-motherlode-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/23/us/got-your-nose-motherlode/got-your-nose-motherlode-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/23/us/got-your-nose-motherlode/got-your-nose-motherlode-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Giving Thanks for a Proper ‘