mpetition to design the Factory Manchester, a major new arts center in Manchester, England.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rem Koolhaas’s Office for Metropolitan Architecture has won an international competition to design the Factory Manchester, a major new arts center in Manchester, England. The project, which the firm won over high-profile shortlisted competitors like Rafael Viñoly, Zaha Hadid and Diller Scofidio + Renfro, will be the first large-scale British building for the Rotterdam-based practice, which this year completed the Garage Museum of Contemporary Art in Moscow and the Fondazione Prada in Milan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rem Koolhaas’s Firm Chosen for New Manchester Arts Center in England', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Koolhaas, Rem', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Office for Metropolitan Architecture', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manchester (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-25T18:32:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roslyn Sulcas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roslyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sulcas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ab713a5-ab63-5603-a3fd-d01be62ea816', 'word_count': 340, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ab713a5-ab63-5603-a3fd-d01be62ea816'}, {'abstract': 'This holiday \xadseason, don’t hold back. A little black dress and heels \xadwill always be right, but glitz and glam summon the holiday spirit. For a festive punch, go for sparkle and stellar accessories. Only a Christmas grouch would \xadsuggest you tone \xadit dow