e of Spies” — the solemn exchange of captives between the United States and the Soviet Union — were ignited in real life at a nondescript Automat on 38th Street just west of Broadway in Manhattan.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/arts/26BRIDGESPIES1/26BRIDGESPIES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 463, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/26/arts/26BRIDGESPIES1/26BRIDGESPIES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 463}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/arts/26BRIDGESPIES1/26BRIDGESPIES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 790, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/arts/26BRIDGESPIES1/26BRIDGESPIES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1525, 'width': 1977, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/arts/26BRIDGESPIES1/26BRIDGESPIES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/26/arts/26BRIDGESPIES1/26BRIDGESPIES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/arts/26BRIDGESPIES1/26BRIDGESPIES1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bad Cheer: The Holiday Exchange Precipitating ‘Bridge of Spies’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A ‘Bridge of Spies’ Back St