in a lively atmosphere.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Delta’s is the kind of place where your expectations are crucial to how much you’ll enjoy yourself. If you’re looking for no-nonsense soul food like your mom made, in an upscale atmosphere — with prices to match — you’re in luck. If you’re expecting a modernized version of soul food, you might be disappointed.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29DINENJ3/29DINENJ3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29DINENJ3/29DINENJ3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 522}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29DINENJ3/29DINENJ3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 890, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29DINENJ3/29DINENJ3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1781, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29DINENJ3/29DINENJ3-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29DINENJ3/29DINENJ3-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29DINENJ3/29DINENJ3-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Restaurant Review: Delta