nd wounding three, in the second recent attack on Bangladesh’s tiny Shiite population.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/27/world/asia/gunmen-strike-shiite-mosque-in-bangladesh.html', 'snippet': 'Gunmen opened fire during evening prayers at the mosque, killing one person and wounding three, in the second recent attack on Bangladesh’s tiny Shiite population.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DHAKA, Bangladesh — Unidentified gunmen opened fire on a Shiite mosque in northern Bangladesh on Thursday evening, killing one man and injuring three others during evening prayer, in an attack that echoes last month’s bombing of a Shiite procession.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gunmen Strike Shiite Mosque in Bangladesh', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gunmen Strike Shiite Mosque in Bangladesh', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bangladesh', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manik, Julfikar Ali', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mosques', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shiite Muslims', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-27T04:11:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julfikar Ali Manik and Ellen Barry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julfikar',