30s ocean liner — cloche hats, woolen jackets, long skirts — crowd together on benches in a large wooden container perched atop a gimbal, a device that can simulate the rolling of a ship. Sitting cross-legged on a long table a few yards away, the director Jill Soloway, who created this Amazon series, quietly throws out a few suggestions to the gently swaying actors.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29TRANSPARENT1/29TRANSPARENT1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29TRANSPARENT1/29TRANSPARENT1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29TRANSPARENT1/29TRANSPARENT1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29TRANSPARENT1/29TRANSPARENT1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1323, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29TRANSPARENT1/29TRANSPARENT1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29TRANSPARENT1/29TRANSPARENT1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/arts/29TRANSPARENT1/29TRANSPARENT1-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In ‘Transparent,’ a Heroine Evolves Further Still', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Heroine Evolves Further Still', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Web-Original Programming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transgender and Transsexuals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Soloway, Jill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tambor, Jeffrey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMAZON.COM INC', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Transparent (TV Program)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-27T13:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margy Rochlin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rochlin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b601cb41-cf0e-5547-946a-e8e9f1f4ca31', 'word_count': 1558, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b601cb41-cf0e-5547-946a-e8e9f1f4ca31'}, {'abstract': 'The editorial board said this week that the Pfizer-Allergan merger should have been illegal. In the ’50s, The Times was much more solicitous.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/27/insider/1957-when-pfizer-and-the-times-worked-closely.html', 'snippet': 'The editorial board said this week that the Pfizer-Allergan merger should have been illegal. In the ’50s, The Times was much more solicitous.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Our editorial board wasted no words this week in describing the planned combination of the drug companies Pfizer and Allergan as a “tax-dodging maneuver that enriches shareholders and executives while shortchanging the public and robbing the Treasury of money.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/insider/26-insider-pfizer-a/26-insider-pfizer-a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/26/insider/26-insider-pfizer-a/26-insider-pfizer-a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 682}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/insider/26-insider-pfizer-a/26-insider-pfizer-a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 901, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/insider/26-insider-pfizer-a/26-insider-pfizer-a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1801, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/insider/26-insider-pfizer-a/26-insider-pfizer-a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/26/insider/26-insider-pfizer-a/26-insider-pfizer-a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/26/insider/26-insider-pfizer-a/26-insider-pfizer-a-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1957 | When Pfizer and The Times Worked Closely', 'kicker': 'Looking Back', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pfizer Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gunther, John (1901-70)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Tribune', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Times', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-27T13:06:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Insider', 'section_name': 'Times Insider', 'byline': {'original': 'By David W. Dunlap', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Dunlap', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/84bdb131-9217-5baa-acec-f04f0a6bf322', 'word_count': 479, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84bdb131-9217-5baa-acec-f04f0a6bf322'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The Red Cross hopes to raise $100 million in 1915.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/27/1915-goal-of-american-red-cross/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The Red Cross hopes to raise $100 million in 1915.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One hundred million dollars is the financial goal of the American Red Cross Society, announced yesterday [Nov. 9] at a meeting held at the residence of Mrs. Whitelaw Reid, 451 Madison Avenue. A movement was also started to place all war relief societies organized here since the outbreak of the war under the direct control of the Red Cross. Miss Mabel Boardman, head of the Red Cross organization, said she hoped the money would be given as an endowment fund to place the society on the same basis as the Rockefeller and Carnegie funds. She urged every man, woman and child in this country to join the Red Cross and give $1.50 a year to help in this new movement for preparedness. Mr. Joseph H. Choate presided at the meeting.\xa0— The New York Herald, European Edition, November 28, 1915', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/blogs/28iht-oldnov28-redcross/28iht-oldnov28-redcross-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/28/blogs/28iht-oldnov28-redcross/28iht-oldnov28-redcross-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/blogs/28iht-oldnov28-redcross/28iht-oldnov28-redcross-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 843, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/blogs/28iht-oldnov28-redcross/28iht-oldnov28-redcross-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 843, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/blogs/28iht-oldnov28-redcross/28iht-oldnov28-redcross-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/28/blogs/28iht-oldnov28-redcross/28iht-oldnov28-redcross-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/blogs/28iht-oldnov28-redcross/28iht-oldnov28-redcross-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1915: Goal of American Red Cross', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_he