': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Schneider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schneider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ed8c386-132f-52e4-99a4-867856d2d5f5', 'word_count': 365, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ed8c386-132f-52e4-99a4-867856d2d5f5'}, {'abstract': 'As Paris talks on new climate targets begin, Bill Gates will unveil a new science push to help achieve emissions goals.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/11/27/as-world-leaders-launch-paris-climate-talks-monday-bill-gates-will-launch-a-supporting-science-push/', 'snippet': 'As Paris talks on new climate targets begin, Bill Gates will unveil a new science push to help achieve emissions goals.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Here’s the White House announcement on “Mission Innovation” and Bill Gates’s explanation of the Breakthrough Energy Coalition:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/blogs/dotemissionsgap2090/dotemissionsgap2090-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 797, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/05/blogs/dotemissionsgap2090/dotemissionsgap2090-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 797}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/blogs/dotemissionsgap2090/dotemissionsgap2090-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 933, 'width': 702, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/05/blogs/dotemissionsgap2090/dotemissionsgap2090-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 933, 'width': 702, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'r