three bands and still looks and dresses like a glam goddess rock star.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/29/nyregion/permanent-punk-invasion.html', 'snippet': 'Denise Mercedes, who is in her 60s, plays in three bands and still looks and dresses like a glam goddess rock star.', 'lead_paragraph': '“This is Pepe,” said Denise Mercedes, pulling out another cigarette and walking past her resplendent white cockatoo. “You should see him dance. He knows more about music than half the people I’ve played with.”', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29CHARACTER/29CHARACTER-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29CHARACTER/29CHARACTER-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29CHARACTER/29CHARACTER-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29CHARACTER/29CHARACTER-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29CHARACTER/29CHARACTER-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29CHARACTER/29CHARACTER-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/