ame': 'persons', 'value': 'Chang, Kenneth', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kannapell, Andrea', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seaborg, Glenn T', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wortham, Jenna', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jstor', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-27T21:28:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2ae4c66-5892-50c0-ae50-08337306491d', 'word_count': 392, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2ae4c66-5892-50c0-ae50-08337306491d'}, {'abstract': 'The main attractions at this Belgian bistro are the seafood options, including the bouillabaise, and moules frites — mussels, steamed in dry vermouth and served with fries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/29/nyregion/belgian-bistro-in-new-haven-connecticut-atelier-florian.html', 'snippet': 'The main attractions at this Belgian bistro are the seafood options, including the bouillabaise, and moules frites — mussels, steamed in dry vermouth and served with fries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Is there a better finish to a cold, blustery day on the New England coast than a steaming bowl of bouillabaisse? I mean the real deal: a rich, tomatoey, fish broth fragrant with saffron, fennel and garlic, and crowded with seafood that — if you’re lucky — was caught just a few miles away.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29DINECT2/29DINECT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/29/n