gitally view items that are located offsite in Newark, N.J., including an 18th-century model of a British butcher’s shop.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/29/nyregion/window-onto-a-butcher-shop-at-the-cooper-hewitt.html', 'snippet': 'The Cooper Hewitt, Smithsonian Design Museum in Manhattan allows visitors to digitally view items that are located offsite in Newark, N.J., including an 18th-century model of a British butcher’s shop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When visitors walk through the big bronze doors of the Cooper Hewitt, Smithsonian Design Museum on the Upper East Side of Manhattan, they are issued the Pen, the institute’s remarkable Internet-accessible stylus. The 1901 Beaux-Arts building then becomes, in the words of The Atlantic magazine, “the museum of the future.”', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29VAULT1/29VAULT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29VAULT1/29VAULT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29VAULT1/29VAULT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29VAULT1/29VAULT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/29VAULT1/29VAULT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': '