 '_id': 'nyt://article/905214bc-0e98-5e55-82d5-0999ba407373', 'word_count': 946, 'uri': 'nyt://article/905214bc-0e98-5e55-82d5-0999ba407373'}, {'abstract': 'If we are serious about replacing fossil fuels, we are going to need nuclear power.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/28/opinion/the-new-atomic-age-we-need.html', 'snippet': 'If we are serious about replacing fossil fuels, we are going to need nuclear power.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THIS past summer, the Group of 7 nations promised “urgent and concrete action” to limit climate change. What actions exactly? Activists hope for answers from the coming United Nations climate conference in Paris, which begins Monday. They should look instead to Washington today.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/opinion/28thiel/28thiel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 811, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/28/opinion/28thiel/28thiel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 811}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/opinion/28thiel/28thiel-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 758, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/opinion/28thiel/28thiel-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1403, 'width': 1038, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/opinion/28thiel/28thiel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/28/opinion/28thiel/28thiel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth'