up his home with support from the Neediest Cases Fund.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/28/opinion/helping-others-and-accepting-help.html', 'snippet': 'A retired man cleans up his home with support from the Neediest Cases Fund.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marvin Grossman, who will turn 79 on Tuesday, is used to doing things on his own. He never married or had children, but his life is filled with reading, writing and classical music. He is always willing to lend a hand to an elderly neighbor by running errands or doing the laundry.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1398, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/29/nyregion/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web/NEEDIEST-Grossman-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Helping Others and Accepting Help', 'kicker': 'The Neediest Cases', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Helping Others and Accepting Help', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'UJA-Federation of New York', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Educational Alliance', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times Neediest Cases Fund', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-11-28T02:49:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a5edb68-3114-54e8-aaab-42e02aa6cf46', 'word_count': 380, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a5edb68-3114-54e8-aaab-42e02aa6cf46'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Hara was lauded for her portrayal of tragic heroines torn between duty and desire. Her abrupt retirement in the 1960s shocked Japan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/28/arts/television/setsuko-hara-japanese-star-of-films-by-ozu-and-kurosawa-is-dead-at-95.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Hara was lauded for her portrayal of tragic heroines torn between duty and desire. Her abrupt retirement in the 1960s shocked Japan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Setsuko Hara, one of Japan’s most beloved actresses, best known for her subtle portrayals of women torn between the demands of family and their own desires in “Late Spring,” “Tokyo Story” and other films directed by Yasujiro Ozu, died on Sept. 5 in Kamakura, near Tokyo. She was 95.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28hara-obit/28hara-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 476, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28hara-obit/28hara-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 476}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28hara-obit/28hara-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 812, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28hara-obit/28hara-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 951, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28hara-obit/28hara-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28hara-obit/28hara-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28hara-obit/28hara-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Setsuko Hara, Japanese Star of Films by Ozu and Kurosawa, Is Dead at 95', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Setsuko Hara, Japanese Star of Films by Ozu and Kurosawa, Is Dead at 95', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituarie