7becb1'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Duddy was an influential curator and advocate for new dance as the founder and director of the dance program at the Dia Center for the Arts (now Joyce SoHo) in Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/28/arts/dance/joan-duddy-nurtured-dance-and-joyce-soho-in-manhattan-dies-at-78.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Duddy was an influential curator and advocate for new dance as the founder and director of the dance program at the Dia Center for the Arts (now Joyce SoHo) in Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joan Duddy, an influential curator and advocate for new dance as the founder and director of the dance program at the Dia Center for the Arts (now Joyce SoHo) in Manhattan for 18 years, died on Nov. 7 in Cambridge, Mass. She was 78.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28duddy-obit/28duddy-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 777, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28duddy-obit/28duddy-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 777}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28duddy-obit/28duddy-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 791, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28duddy-obit/28duddy-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1028, 'width': 794, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/28/arts/28duddy-obit/28duddy-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'im