473, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ccf99bb3-4fd7-544a-95b9-c066b0c73a8f'}, {'abstract': 'The season’s books include Kliph Nesteroff’s history of comedy, stuffed with obscure trivia and arguments that challenge common wisdom.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/12/06/books/review/humor-the-comedians-a-carlin-home-companion-and-more.html', 'snippet': 'The season’s books include Kliph Nesteroff’s history of comedy, stuffed with obscure trivia and arguments that challenge common wisdom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No one ever questions the value of analyzing tragedy, but skepticism about breaking down comedy is a strangely enduring prejudice. Blame E.B. White. “Humor can be dissected, as a frog can,” he memorably groused, “but the thing dies in the process and the innards are discouraging to any but the purely scientific mind.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '58', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/12/06/books/review/1206-BKS-Humor/1206-BKS-Humor-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/12/06/books/review/1206-BKS-Humor/1206-BKS-Humor-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/12/06/books/review/1206-BKS-Humor/1206-BKS-Humor-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/12/06/books/review/1206-BKS-Humor/1206-BKS-Humor-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1004, 'width': 1495, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/12/06/books/review/1206-BKS-Humor/1206-BKS-Hum