s too heartless for the presidency and highlights his recent mocking of a disabled reporter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/11/30/john-kasich-ad-assails-donald-trump-for-mocking-disabled-reporter/', 'snippet': 'Gov. John Kasich of Ohio took Donald J. Trump to task in a new advertisement that paints the billionaire businessman as too heartless for the presidency and highlights his recent mocking of a disabled reporter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. John Kasich of Ohio has become one of the Republican Party’s fiercest critics of Donald J. Trump, even likening his policy proposals to those of the Nazis. On Monday, Mr. Kasich took Mr. Trump to task again in a new advertisement that paints the billionaire businessman as too heartless for the presidency and highlights his recent mocking of a disabled reporter.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/30/us/30firstdraft-kasich/30firstdraft-kasich-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/11/30/us/30firstdraft-kasich/30firstdraft-kasich-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/30/us/30firstdraft-kasich/30firstdraft-kasich-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/30/us/30firstdraft-kasich/30firstdraft-kasich-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/11/30/us/30firstdraft-kasich/30firstdraft-kasich-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, '